(501717, 48889, 509, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot.  Unfortunately, it is blatantly against the topic rules = (<br/>The shot was not supposed to contain actual currency.  As it does not conform to the restrictions, I have to give this a low score, sorry.</td>', 'Not a bad shot.  Unfortunately, it is blatantly against the topic rules = (The shot was not supposed to contain actual currency.  As it does not conform to the restrictions, I have to give this a low score, sorry.', '2003-12-03 00:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(501718, 49328, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white.  The contrast in particular is well done.</td>', 'Nice use of black and white.  The contrast in particular is well done.', '2003-12-03 00:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(501724, 48935, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  I would try a different light source (maybe stronger?) The lighting on the board seems a little off, but that should be fixable with a different white balance (looking at the boardwalk title card, the white seems to have a bit of a green/yellow tint).  I''m not sure about the cropping either, it is a little too tight imho.<br/>-5-</td>', 'I like the idea.  I would try a different light source (maybe stronger?) The lighting on the board seems a little off, but that should be fixable with a different white balance (looking at the boardwalk title card, the white seems to have a bit of a green/yellow tint).  I''m not sure about the cropping either, it is a little too tight imho.-5-', '2003-12-03 00:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(501726, 49419, 509, '<td valign="top">I like this idea a lot, but i''m not wild about pictures of pictures (ie, the horses).  It seems to be using someone elses work when the picture is a major part of the overall image.  I''m guessing real horses were not available (hence the title), so I''m not really sure how I would change this. -6-</td>', 'I like this idea a lot, but i''m not wild about pictures of pictures (ie, the horses).  It seems to be using someone elses work when the picture is a major part of the overall image.  I''m guessing real horses were not available (hence the title), so I''m not really sure how I would change this. -6-', '2003-12-03 00:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
