(501868, 49151, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good idea; I like the placement of the cards in the stocking.  Composition is good as well, with the diagonal of the stocking.  I think you should have posted this one in color: the main issue is the exceptionally bright and overexposed white area of the stocking and the very dark background.  The colors would have reduced that contrast some, but it might have also been a good idea to use fill lights or natural light to get more exposure on the tree.</td>', 'Good idea; I like the placement of the cards in the stocking.  Composition is good as well, with the diagonal of the stocking.  I think you should have posted this one in color: the main issue is the exceptionally bright and overexposed white area of the stocking and the very dark background.  The colors would have reduced that contrast some, but it might have also been a good idea to use fill lights or natural light to get more exposure on the tree.', '2003-12-03 01:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(501869, 49371, 12902, '<td valign="top">This is such a funny picture... Looks a bit too busy though.... I wish you had a black or a green, gambling like background, maybe I would have cut off one of the glasses, but what it is is what it is. The cat looks very concentrated. How did he (she) do until the last? 9</td>', 'This is such a funny picture... Looks a bit too busy though.... I wish you had a black or a green, gambling like background, maybe I would have cut off one of the glasses, but what it is is what it is. The cat looks very concentrated. How did he (she) do until the last? 9', '2003-12-03 01:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(501870, 49426, 12253, '<td valign="top">I think you are providing too much information on the cards to anyone who can see them.  A good shot otherwise, though low on the creativity scale.</td>', 'I think you are providing too much information on the cards to anyone who can see them.  A good shot otherwise, though low on the creativity scale.', '2003-12-03 01:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
