(501874, 49245, 12253, '<td valign="top">No, not wise.  The toilet will clog and you will have to hire a plumber, which will cost a lot!  <br/> <br/>This is very creative anyway, but I do have a few nits with the photo itself.  Next time try some more interesting lighting; side light would have worked well here.  Also, I might have tried some other angles, or at least a different crop; I am not sure the asymmetry works well here.</td>', 'No, not wise.  The toilet will clog and you will have to hire a plumber, which will cost a lot!   This is very creative anyway, but I do have a few nits with the photo itself.  Next time try some more interesting lighting; side light would have worked well here.  Also, I might have tried some other angles, or at least a different crop; I am not sure the asymmetry works well here.', '2003-12-03 01:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
