(501998, 49414, 7263, '<td valign="top">really really nice shot, very well lit with a very distinctive and attractive background. Lighting is superb with a nice visable backlight.<br/> <br/>But....relevence to the challenge is so thin it''s wafer thin. "Capture an image representing money". I am sure she does cost you some cash (especialy this time of year) but as an icon representing money it''s way off.<br/> <br/>Best shot of the challenge though - personaly i would have kept it and submitted to the best of december open challenge.</td>', 'really really nice shot, very well lit with a very distinctive and attractive background. Lighting is superb with a nice visable backlight. But....relevence to the challenge is so thin it''s wafer thin. "Capture an image representing money". I am sure she does cost you some cash (especialy this time of year) but as an icon representing money it''s way off. Best shot of the challenge though - personaly i would have kept it and submitted to the best of december open challenge.', '2003-12-03 04:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(501999, 49289, 7263, '<td valign="top">super shot with super lighting. Quite emotive.<br/>To be picky, I would have liked to have seen less red in the fingers, and perhaps some dirt or cuts (but I guess cuts would be silly)<br/> <br/>Good luck, a top 3 for sure.</td>', 'super shot with super lighting. Quite emotive.To be picky, I would have liked to have seen less red in the fingers, and perhaps some dirt or cuts (but I guess cuts would be silly) Good luck, a top 3 for sure.', '2003-12-03 04:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(502001, 49140, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very unusual effect on the rocks, I like it.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Very unusual effect on the rocks, I like it.  Nice shot.', '2003-12-03 04:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
