(502006, 48872, 10170, '<td valign="top">Where do I sign again?  Absolutely sensational, has to be in the running for a ribbon here.  The lighting is lovely, the warmth adds to the highly sensual feeling to this photo.  The model heself is absolutely stunning, just the perfect shape and curves to produce those lovely shadows.  This is my choice of the challenge.  10.</td>', 'Where do I sign again?  Absolutely sensational, has to be in the running for a ribbon here.  The lighting is lovely, the warmth adds to the highly sensual feeling to this photo.  The model heself is absolutely stunning, just the perfect shape and curves to produce those lovely shadows.  This is my choice of the challenge.  10.', '2003-12-03 04:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(502007, 48889, 10170, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but the challenge specifically stated not to use money in the photo, so this really fails to meet the challenge.</td>', 'Sorry, but the challenge specifically stated not to use money in the photo, so this really fails to meet the challenge.', '2003-12-03 04:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
