(502122, 49321, 12733, '<td valign="top">The lighting is obviously arranged to make a point and focus in on some of the bills, but the heavy shadows end up being more distracting than enhancing.</td>', 'The lighting is obviously arranged to make a point and focus in on some of the bills, but the heavy shadows end up being more distracting than enhancing.', '2003-12-03 08:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
