(502494, 49343, 9906, '<td valign="top">Heeheehee....Is this the right challenge? (wink)  I like the shot but am quite distracted by the sign in the window and the reflections of the power lines.  If you cropped just under the pie piece shaped window (above the ugly sign) you would have a more powerful composition.  Nice focus and lighting!</td>', 'Heeheehee....Is this the right challenge? (wink)  I like the shot but am quite distracted by the sign in the window and the reflections of the power lines.  If you cropped just under the pie piece shaped window (above the ugly sign) you would have a more powerful composition.  Nice focus and lighting!', '2003-12-03 12:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(502495, 48933, 9906, '<td valign="top">....and blowing it on the lottery?  Just kidding.  On a serious note, your colors here are very flat.  You either need more light or you need to play around with levels and saturations in your editing software to bring out the color.  Nice composition and I actually like the odd angle on this one.  Now if you coulda got actual rain falling....<br/>TC</td>', '....and blowing it on the lottery?  Just kidding.  On a serious note, your colors here are very flat.  You either need more light or you need to play around with levels and saturations in your editing software to bring out the color.  Nice composition and I actually like the odd angle on this one.  Now if you coulda got actual rain falling....TC', '2003-12-03 12:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
