(502849, 49419, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice composition for this challenge.  You have a goal and a plan all laid out in one image.  The plan might not be the best one, but it\''s there and easy to understand.  From a technical standpoint, the bank appears to be under exposed.  Also I would rather the sharpness be with the bank and the softness be on the image of the ''dream''.  Nice shot that with a little more work could be an awesome one!<br/>Kudos,<br/>TC</td>', 'This is a very nice composition for this challenge.  You have a goal and a plan all laid out in one image.  The plan might not be the best one, but it\''s there and easy to understand.  From a technical standpoint, the bank appears to be under exposed.  Also I would rather the sharpness be with the bank and the softness be on the image of the ''dream''.  Nice shot that with a little more work could be an awesome one!Kudos,TC', '2003-12-03 18:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(502850, 49287, 9906, '<td valign="top">Not a bad exposure.  A touch oversharp but not horribly so.  My biggest complaint is that you detract from the richness of the object by stealing it''s richness of color.<br/>TC</td>', 'Not a bad exposure.  A touch oversharp but not horribly so.  My biggest complaint is that you detract from the richness of the object by stealing it''s richness of color.TC', '2003-12-03 18:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
