(502949, 49122, 9109, '<td valign="top">My 2 cents - I think this is good DOF used in the wrong way. The picture focuses the viewer''s attention on the numbers 2031 but there''s little/no significance in it alone. Although we all know that this is a credit card, the DOF seems to be trying to tell a different story which doesn''t mesh well.</td>', 'My 2 cents - I think this is good DOF used in the wrong way. The picture focuses the viewer''s attention on the numbers 2031 but there''s little/no significance in it alone. Although we all know that this is a credit card, the DOF seems to be trying to tell a different story which doesn''t mesh well.', '2003-12-03 20:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
