(502992, 48997, 6938, '<td valign="top">I agree.     I''m not sure about the lighting though.... mabe some fill from the top left is needed?</td>', 'I agree.     I''m not sure about the lighting though.... mabe some fill from the top left is needed?', '2003-12-03 21:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(502994, 49249, 6938, '<td valign="top">Very Clever.  I like the small area of focus..... highlights the punchline.  The flare in the top right is rather distracting though.</td>', 'Very Clever.  I like the small area of focus..... highlights the punchline.  The flare in the top right is rather distracting though.', '2003-12-03 21:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(502996, 49034, 327, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet you did this hand held. The focus is soft but the crop is interesting. Keep trying. Good color and lighting.</td>', 'I''ll bet you did this hand held. The focus is soft but the crop is interesting. Keep trying. Good color and lighting.', '2003-12-03 21:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(502997, 48715, 327, '<td valign="top">This was a good idea. However your focus is too soft and that with the busy table cloth is not good. Keep trying. Nice colors.</td>', 'This was a good idea. However your focus is too soft and that with the busy table cloth is not good. Keep trying. Nice colors.', '2003-12-03 21:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(502998, 49373, 6938, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what your title is trying to tell me.     Great Photo.....   perhaps a bit of paper or a different light position could have reduced the flare on the stud though?</td>', 'I''m not sure what your title is trying to tell me.     Great Photo.....   perhaps a bit of paper or a different light position could have reduced the flare on the stud though?', '2003-12-03 21:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(502999, 49163, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the title and the final notice text. The problems are the lighting and the perspective view of the wallet. Your color is good. Keep trying. Good luck.</td>', 'Love the title and the final notice text. The problems are the lighting and the perspective view of the wallet. Your color is good. Keep trying. Good luck.', '2003-12-03 21:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(503000, 49029, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute old piggy bank. The focus is soft here but the crop and composition is very nice. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute old piggy bank. The focus is soft here but the crop and composition is very nice. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-12-03 21:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(503002, 49417, 6938, '<td valign="top">A bit more symetry - a shade too much seems cropped off the bottom and left side.<br/>The focus also seems a bit off.     Great Idea!</td>', 'A bit more symetry - a shade too much seems cropped off the bottom and left side.The focus also seems a bit off.     Great Idea!', '2003-12-03 21:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(503004, 49278, 6938, '<td valign="top">Ecellent timimg for light, and great focus.   Nice depiction of wealth.</td>', 'Ecellent timimg for light, and great focus.   Nice depiction of wealth.', '2003-12-03 21:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(503007, 49240, 6938, '<td valign="top">First impression:  the white background is way to much!   after that......  get rid of the crumb near the 3,   lie the ring down more so more of the band shows.   Good Idea, just needs some polishing.</td>', 'First impression:  the white background is way to much!   after that......  get rid of the crumb near the 3,   lie the ring down more so more of the band shows.   Good Idea, just needs some polishing.', '2003-12-03 21:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(503008, 49287, 6938, '<td valign="top">Nice Focus,  lighting, and coversion to B/W.</td>', 'Nice Focus,  lighting, and coversion to B/W.', '2003-12-03 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(503010, 49396, 327, '<td valign="top">Yes, it is power. I think your example here is weak. It''s not screaming power!! The building/plant appear small,  not a giant company with mega bucks. :) The quality of the shot is very good. The focus, light, color....beautifully shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Yes, it is power. I think your example here is weak. It''s not screaming power!! The building/plant appear small,  not a giant company with mega bucks. :) The quality of the shot is very good. The focus, light, color....beautifully shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-12-03 21:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(503012, 49430, 327, '<td valign="top">I love this stuff and thing it''s way better then the vanilla coke. Yum. Nice shot, nice color, cool perspective. I hope you do well, good luck.</td>', 'I love this stuff and thing it''s way better then the vanilla coke. Yum. Nice shot, nice color, cool perspective. I hope you do well, good luck.', '2003-12-03 21:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(503013, 49383, 6938, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked the fingers to be in focus as well.  oh, and just to be picky, there looks like a wrinkle up by the "and".....  its distracting ..... ;o)<br/></td>', 'I think I would have liked the fingers to be in focus as well.  oh, and just to be picky, there looks like a wrinkle up by the "and".....  its distracting ..... ;o)', '2003-12-03 21:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(503030, 48841, 6938, '<td valign="top">Nice depiction.....  Great lighting and focus.  Mabe some more light to the right (are there egs back there?) would have added some depth.    I realy like the positioning.<br/></td>', 'Nice depiction.....  Great lighting and focus.  Mabe some more light to the right (are there egs back there?) would have added some depth.    I realy like the positioning.', '2003-12-03 21:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(503037, 49327, 5822, '<td valign="top">Not sure why you went for the sepia toning, but I don''t think it adds anything to the image.  I would have really liked to see this picture in color. Also, the lighting is too harsh and has given the image an overexposed look.  I''m not really crazy about the triangular pile of houses. It seems their only purpose is to obscure a lacking top half of the photo.</td>', 'Not sure why you went for the sepia toning, but I don''t think it adds anything to the image.  I would have really liked to see this picture in color. Also, the lighting is too harsh and has given the image an overexposed look.  I''m not really crazy about the triangular pile of houses. It seems their only purpose is to obscure a lacking top half of the photo.', '2003-12-03 21:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(503038, 49245, 13305, '<td valign="top">Good idea.   But back off a little bit to allow the toilet to be more easily identified.</td>', 'Good idea.   But back off a little bit to allow the toilet to be more easily identified.', '2003-12-03 21:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(503042, 48795, 509, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, the foreboding clouds, the worn out building...the connection to the challenge is a little vague, but I think I understand it.  Nice work <br/>-7-</td>', 'I really like this image, the foreboding clouds, the worn out building...the connection to the challenge is a little vague, but I think I understand it.  Nice work -7-', '2003-12-03 21:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(503045, 49282, 13305, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but lighten it up a bit so the stuff shows up a little more.</td>', 'Nice idea, but lighten it up a bit so the stuff shows up a little more.', '2003-12-03 21:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(503047, 49415, 11769, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea. All the little problems Im sure youll hear so I just say I like this a lot.</td>', 'Wonderful idea. All the little problems Im sure youll hear so I just say I like this a lot.', '2003-12-03 22:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(503048, 49354, 14189, '<td valign="top">A fuzzy piggy bank? Won''t it be hard to break open with a hammer?</td>', 'A fuzzy piggy bank? Won''t it be hard to break open with a hammer?', '2003-12-03 22:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(503049, 49213, 11769, '<td valign="top">My eyes never see much of this, so it is refreshing to see someone else with the luck to see it. Nicely done.</td>', 'My eyes never see much of this, so it is refreshing to see someone else with the luck to see it. Nicely done.', '2003-12-03 22:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(503053, 49392, 11769, '<td valign="top">Monkey?   OH money! Great! Yes, I do like it. 9</td>', 'Monkey?   OH money! Great! Yes, I do like it. 9', '2003-12-03 22:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(503055, 49037, 11769, '<td valign="top">Perfect.10</td>', 'Perfect.10', '2003-12-03 22:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(503057, 49073, 14189, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. The multi-directional shadows and varying colors of the squares are a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like the idea. The multi-directional shadows and varying colors of the squares are a bit distracting.', '2003-12-03 22:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(503058, 49140, 11769, '<td valign="top">This be good photo I say. Like the time lapse effect, so nice. Fits the challenge to.</td>', 'This be good photo I say. Like the time lapse effect, so nice. Fits the challenge to.', '2003-12-03 22:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(503059, 49364, 11769, '<td valign="top">Looks good. 10</td>', 'Looks good. 10', '2003-12-03 22:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(503061, 49213, 14189, '<td valign="top">Has money caught (grabbed) her eye, or is the model the money grabber?</td>', 'Has money caught (grabbed) her eye, or is the model the money grabber?', '2003-12-03 22:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(503062, 49388, 14189, '<td valign="top">A striking image.</td>', 'A striking image.', '2003-12-03 22:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(503063, 49396, 13305, '<td valign="top">This would work better for me if the power plant were all lit up at night.</td>', 'This would work better for me if the power plant were all lit up at night.', '2003-12-03 22:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(503065, 49401, 12425, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, the extra shallow DOF works nicely for me.</td>', 'Lovely photo, the extra shallow DOF works nicely for me.', '2003-12-03 22:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(503066, 49151, 13305, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better in color.</td>', 'I would have liked this better in color.', '2003-12-03 22:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(503067, 49351, 5822, '<td valign="top">The post-processing and application of blue duotoning gives this picture an eerie and other-worldly feel to it, as if I were viewing the surface of the moon from an orbiting lunar probe.  IMO, this has done a disservice to the image as it appears to have degraded much of the surface detail that would have been present otherwise. I would have preferred to see this image in color, but even so, without your title, the photo doesn''t speak to me of "money."</td>', 'The post-processing and application of blue duotoning gives this picture an eerie and other-worldly feel to it, as if I were viewing the surface of the moon from an orbiting lunar probe.  IMO, this has done a disservice to the image as it appears to have degraded much of the surface detail that would have been present otherwise. I would have preferred to see this image in color, but even so, without your title, the photo doesn''t speak to me of "money."', '2003-12-03 22:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(503068, 49298, 14189, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. I don''t know too many illegal narcotics manufacturers who take the time to inscribe on their pills...  I''m sure the authorities would like it if they did.</td>', 'Interesting photo. I don''t know too many illegal narcotics manufacturers who take the time to inscribe on their pills...  I''m sure the authorities would like it if they did.', '2003-12-03 22:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(503070, 49268, 13305, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped/straightened the image. Nice idea though.</td>', 'I think I would have cropped/straightened the image. Nice idea though.', '2003-12-03 22:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(503071, 49392, 13305, '<td valign="top">Very unique idea. try a different background to make things show up more.</td>', 'Very unique idea. try a different background to make things show up more.', '2003-12-03 22:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(503072, 49374, 13305, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Why not show only 1 box to focus the eye on, this is a little confusing at first.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Why not show only 1 box to focus the eye on, this is a little confusing at first.', '2003-12-03 22:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(503074, 49404, 10799, '<td valign="top">This might be stronger if there was more of the surroundings visible.... a different angle.  The signs are difficult to read so maybe if the photo had been taking to show the man on the bike from the side and more of the buildings.</td>', 'This might be stronger if there was more of the surroundings visible.... a different angle.  The signs are difficult to read so maybe if the photo had been taking to show the man on the bike from the side and more of the buildings.', '2003-12-03 22:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(503078, 49294, 3724, '<td valign="top">Nice evening visual.....  I love those jokes about full parking lots at casinos and walmart.....</td>', 'Nice evening visual.....  I love those jokes about full parking lots at casinos and walmart.....', '2003-12-03 22:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(503080, 49397, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but think it could have been carried out better. First, the lighting seems too harsh and there seems to be glare coming off the whites of the cards. Secondly, I would have preferred a green felt background to mimick the kinds of tables that poker is played on.  I also would have preferred to see real coin scattered about and in more abundance than the stingy single token in the image.</td>', 'I like the concept, but think it could have been carried out better. First, the lighting seems too harsh and there seems to be glare coming off the whites of the cards. Secondly, I would have preferred a green felt background to mimick the kinds of tables that poker is played on.  I also would have preferred to see real coin scattered about and in more abundance than the stingy single token in the image.', '2003-12-03 22:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(503082, 49213, 14718, '<td valign="top">Very clever</td>', 'Very clever', '2003-12-03 23:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(503085, 49328, 5822, '<td valign="top">Really nice use of negative space and I like the way the shirt cuff and hands are  showing, but I find the shirt behind the cards distracting and wish it weren''t showing. Also, it would have been nice to see both arms showing the white cuffs. If this were a staged shot, a ncie pair of colored or gold cufflinks would be good too.</td>', 'Really nice use of negative space and I like the way the shirt cuff and hands are  showing, but I find the shirt behind the cards distracting and wish it weren''t showing. Also, it would have been nice to see both arms showing the white cuffs. If this were a staged shot, a ncie pair of colored or gold cufflinks would be good too.', '2003-12-03 23:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(503087, 49363, 14718, '<td valign="top">Is this a little blurry ????  But apart from that I liked the caption.</td>', 'Is this a little blurry ????  But apart from that I liked the caption.', '2003-12-03 23:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(503092, 49370, 6938, '<td valign="top">I like your idea,   But it''s a bit too soft for me.</td>', 'I like your idea,   But it''s a bit too soft for me.', '2003-12-03 23:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(503097, 49140, 6938, '<td valign="top">Mabe a pan in the water would have put your idea into the photo more.   Good photo.</td>', 'Mabe a pan in the water would have put your idea into the photo more.   Good photo.', '2003-12-03 23:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(503102, 49426, 6938, '<td valign="top">I like your take.</td>', 'I like your take.', '2003-12-03 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(503103, 49415, 5822, '<td valign="top">Excellent take on the challenge and I like the composition very much, especially the bowtie on the candy...Very well placed!  Only things I can see critiquing are the lighting being too harsh and I don''t like that the two areas of the black background came out different looking.  The lower left shows much more sparkles than the upper right. I enjoyed viewing this photo very much...well done, and good luck in the challenge...I''m rooting for you.</td>', 'Excellent take on the challenge and I like the composition very much, especially the bowtie on the candy...Very well placed!  Only things I can see critiquing are the lighting being too harsh and I don''t like that the two areas of the black background came out different looking.  The lower left shows much more sparkles than the upper right. I enjoyed viewing this photo very much...well done, and good luck in the challenge...I''m rooting for you.', '2003-12-03 23:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(503106, 49302, 6938, '<td valign="top">To be historically picky - are the fox and rabbit traps relevant to the period you are depicting?   otherwise.:   nice warm lighting , good focus.  good unique take on the challenge.</td>', 'To be historically picky - are the fox and rabbit traps relevant to the period you are depicting?   otherwise.:   nice warm lighting , good focus.  good unique take on the challenge.', '2003-12-03 23:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(503108, 49009, 14718, '<td valign="top">Oh isn''t it ever!!!</td>', 'Oh isn''t it ever!!!', '2003-12-03 23:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(503110, 49357, 6938, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, good focus.....     a big piece of white material might have been usefull in getting rid of the reflection.     Nice photo.<br/></td>', 'Nice lighting, good focus.....     a big piece of white material might have been usefull in getting rid of the reflection.     Nice photo.', '2003-12-03 23:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(503115, 49015, 5822, '<td valign="top">While I like the combination and saturation of the colors here, I find the orientation of the watch to be troublesome and the lighting to be too harsh.  Also wish the background were better lit. Good focus too.</td>', 'While I like the combination and saturation of the colors here, I find the orientation of the watch to be troublesome and the lighting to be too harsh.  Also wish the background were better lit. Good focus too.', '2003-12-03 23:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(503118, 49160, 6938, '<td valign="top">Thankyou for the humor in an otherwise possibly depressing shot.    Nice contrast in the B/W conversion.</td>', 'Thankyou for the humor in an otherwise possibly depressing shot.    Nice contrast in the B/W conversion.', '2003-12-03 23:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(503120, 49363, 6938, '<td valign="top">Suggestion:  I''m Australian.   To increase it''s impact, to make it look less like a general miscelanious form,  the wording  " Income Tax Return" needs to be more noticeable.<br/>I like your interpretation.<br/></td>', 'Suggestion:  I''m Australian.   To increase it''s impact, to make it look less like a general miscelanious form,  the wording  " Income Tax Return" needs to be more noticeable.I like your interpretation.', '2003-12-03 23:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(503123, 49417, 14749, '<td valign="top">Creative!</td>', 'Creative!', '2003-12-03 23:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(503124, 48999, 14749, '<td valign="top">Nice Contrast!</td>', 'Nice Contrast!', '2003-12-03 23:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(503125, 49298, 14749, '<td valign="top">The black and White adds a lot to this photo.  Nice creativity!</td>', 'The black and White adds a lot to this photo.  Nice creativity!', '2003-12-03 23:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(503127, 49419, 14749, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2003-12-03 23:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(503128, 49428, 14749, '<td valign="top">Hey!!! I have a protege 5 too!!!</td>', 'Hey!!! I have a protege 5 too!!!', '2003-12-03 23:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(503130, 49245, 14749, '<td valign="top">Agree!!!!</td>', 'Agree!!!!', '2003-12-03 23:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(503132, 49321, 14749, '<td valign="top">I like what you did with the lighting!</td>', 'I like what you did with the lighting!', '2003-12-03 23:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(503135, 49289, 14749, '<td valign="top">Very powerful statement!  I really like this picture!  Nice job!  Nice title!</td>', 'Very powerful statement!  I really like this picture!  Nice job!  Nice title!', '2003-12-03 23:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(503136, 49260, 14749, '<td valign="top">Did that hurt????</td>', 'Did that hurt????', '2003-12-03 23:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(503142, 49317, 14749, '<td valign="top">Thats Great!</td>', 'Thats Great!', '2003-12-03 23:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(503152, 49383, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very good arrangement of picture elements but the lighting is too harsh and the colors look washed out and dull. DOF is very good.</td>', 'Very good arrangement of picture elements but the lighting is too harsh and the colors look washed out and dull. DOF is very good.', '2003-12-03 23:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(503159, 49409, 9109, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, I can understand that feeling. :)</td>', 'Very nicely done, I can understand that feeling. :)', '2003-12-04 00:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(503174, 49213, 9763, '<td valign="top">Is that a reflection?  If it is... wow!  Your model does need a tad bit of powder to help keep the shine down in the photo.  I think green mascara or eyeliner would have been a great effect too!</td>', 'Is that a reflection?  If it is... wow!  Your model does need a tad bit of powder to help keep the shine down in the photo.  I think green mascara or eyeliner would have been a great effect too!', '2003-12-04 00:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
