(503690, 49405, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract background, frames in a fun way, pleasing  and eventually I see it is pine needles?  I''m not sure you needed to include the jewelry in the foreground.  Even our of focus, it is distracting.  Light seems a bit warm (pink-yellow) Nice to have a bit to make the picture warm, but maybe a little less.</td>', 'I like the abstract background, frames in a fun way, pleasing  and eventually I see it is pine needles?  I''m not sure you needed to include the jewelry in the foreground.  Even our of focus, it is distracting.  Light seems a bit warm (pink-yellow) Nice to have a bit to make the picture warm, but maybe a little less.', '2003-12-04 15:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(503692, 48965, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting to look at - strong diagonal. interesting light.  However it just doesn''t come together for me, I don''t know what it is, which isn''t such a big deal, but I don''t understand what its saying either.</td>', 'Interesting to look at - strong diagonal. interesting light.  However it just doesn''t come together for me, I don''t know what it is, which isn''t such a big deal, but I don''t understand what its saying either.', '2003-12-04 15:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(503693, 49415, 7628, '<td valign="top">funny, original.  Nice touch with the bow tie!  Upper right corner works better than lower left because there is less glare off the background material.  composition feels a bit cramped.</td>', 'funny, original.  Nice touch with the bow tie!  Upper right corner works better than lower left because there is less glare off the background material.  composition feels a bit cramped.', '2003-12-04 15:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(503696, 48854, 7628, '<td valign="top">I''d crop in on the left and right - the sign would be even more dramatic looming over a vertical composition.  If you could get a stronger sense of the street stretching out infront of you it would be great.</td>', 'I''d crop in on the left and right - the sign would be even more dramatic looming over a vertical composition.  If you could get a stronger sense of the street stretching out infront of you it would be great.', '2003-12-04 16:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(503702, 49091, 7628, '<td valign="top">fantastically sharp!  Fresh lighting, nicely balanced composition without being too obvious</td>', 'fantastically sharp!  Fresh lighting, nicely balanced composition without being too obvious', '2003-12-04 16:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(503703, 49053, 12661, '<td valign="top">I like the framing, however, the Nordstrom building in the background is too blown out.</td>', 'I like the framing, however, the Nordstrom building in the background is too blown out.', '2003-12-04 16:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(503720, 49295, 14671, '<td valign="top">aren''t these a type of currency???</td>', 'aren''t these a type of currency???', '2003-12-04 16:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(503729, 49404, 12661, '<td valign="top">If that''s Nantucket, I get it. But I am afraid it may be over many people''s head.</td>', 'If that''s Nantucket, I get it. But I am afraid it may be over many people''s head.', '2003-12-04 16:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(503733, 48995, 6938, '<td valign="top">There are too many indistinct shapes here for me to get a real feeling of "money".   Is it a chocolate mould?</td>', 'There are too many indistinct shapes here for me to get a real feeling of "money".   Is it a chocolate mould?', '2003-12-04 16:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(503735, 49392, 12661, '<td valign="top">Mickey - ice = mky<br/>Honeybear - H = oneybear.<br/> <br/>mky oneybear??? I don''t get it. (Just kidding) Cute concept and beautifully interpreted.</td>', 'Mickey - ice = mkyHoneybear - H = oneybear. mky oneybear??? I don''t get it. (Just kidding) Cute concept and beautifully interpreted.', '2003-12-04 16:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(503737, 49252, 6938, '<td valign="top">Great depiction!   Great lighting,  Great focus and DOF.</td>', 'Great depiction!   Great lighting,  Great focus and DOF.', '2003-12-04 16:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(503741, 49379, 6938, '<td valign="top">Mabe I would have felt the shopping urge more if the shoes/clothes in the wall at the back were the subject instead of the manequin?   Nice focus and use of existing lighting, and I like the composition.     Good photo - just doesn''t have a big "money" impact.</td>', 'Mabe I would have felt the shopping urge more if the shoes/clothes in the wall at the back were the subject instead of the manequin?   Nice focus and use of existing lighting, and I like the composition.     Good photo - just doesn''t have a big "money" impact.', '2003-12-04 16:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(503745, 49283, 6938, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject.  The border also works with it.   Mabe if you captured an actuall transaction the theme "money" would have been stronger.   Great colours,  great lighting,  mabe a shorter exposure woudl have sharped the details of the near table a bit more. (nice Feel as is though)</td>', 'Good choice of subject.  The border also works with it.   Mabe if you captured an actuall transaction the theme "money" would have been stronger.   Great colours,  great lighting,  mabe a shorter exposure woudl have sharped the details of the near table a bit more. (nice Feel as is though)', '2003-12-04 17:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
