(503962, 49260, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge, exposure, composition and focus are good, lighting is even.<br/>Personal: I think it''s a good idea and it''s interesting to look at- and I like the border!<br/>How many pairs of jeans did you have to ruin for this shot?!?!? <br/> <br/>My vote: 7.</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge, exposure, composition and focus are good, lighting is even.Personal: I think it''s a good idea and it''s interesting to look at- and I like the border!How many pairs of jeans did you have to ruin for this shot?!?!?  My vote: 7.', '2003-12-04 18:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(503966, 49408, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge, exposure is good; composition- I like the low angle;  focus- I''d like a little more depth of field- perhaps the guy could be just a tad sharper? Lighting is good, lends itself to the shot.<br/> <br/>Personal: I think it''s a good idea and it''s interesting to look at. The line from the gun to the hand leads well. <br/> <br/>My vote: 8.</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge, exposure is good; composition- I like the low angle;  focus- I''d like a little more depth of field- perhaps the guy could be just a tad sharper? Lighting is good, lends itself to the shot. Personal: I think it''s a good idea and it''s interesting to look at. The line from the gun to the hand leads well.  My vote: 8.', '2003-12-04 18:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(503971, 49360, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge, exposure, composition and focus are good, lighting is appealing.<br/> <br/>Personal: Fits the challenge but neither the subject nor the way it was shot strike me as particularly creative. The border seems kinda Halloweeny but I''m not marking down for it.<br/> <br/>My vote: 5.</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge, exposure, composition and focus are good, lighting is appealing. Personal: Fits the challenge but neither the subject nor the way it was shot strike me as particularly creative. The border seems kinda Halloweeny but I''m not marking down for it. My vote: 5.', '2003-12-04 18:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(503972, 49346, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Without the title it wouldn''t fit the challenge. Exposure, composition and focus are good, lighting is appealing.<br/> <br/>Personal: I''m all for the title explaining the shot, but in this case it seems like quite a stretch. As for the photo itself, I really like the movement- beautifully shot.<br/> <br/>My vote: 6.</td>', 'Technical: Without the title it wouldn''t fit the challenge. Exposure, composition and focus are good, lighting is appealing. Personal: I''m all for the title explaining the shot, but in this case it seems like quite a stretch. As for the photo itself, I really like the movement- beautifully shot. My vote: 6.', '2003-12-04 19:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(503974, 49339, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Trees are relatively well exposed, but that means your main subject is overexposed. Composition could have been better for the subject. Focus and lighting are difficult because of the composition. Perhaps getting close to the trees and shooting the house "in the clear" would have made this a better shot given the challenge.<br/> <br/>Personal: I feel like maybe you didn''t want the owner to see you photographing their house! It feels like a snapshot.<br/> <br/>My vote: 3.</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Trees are relatively well exposed, but that means your main subject is overexposed. Composition could have been better for the subject. Focus and lighting are difficult because of the composition. Perhaps getting close to the trees and shooting the house "in the clear" would have made this a better shot given the challenge. Personal: I feel like maybe you didn''t want the owner to see you photographing their house! It feels like a snapshot. My vote: 3.', '2003-12-04 19:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(503975, 49339, 6999, '<td valign="top">Love the point of view taken here - like an intruder, almost. think I would have prefered it exposed properly for the house, and leaving the trees in silhouette - that sense of exclusion wouldn''t be harmed by that, surely?</td>', 'Love the point of view taken here - like an intruder, almost. think I would have prefered it exposed properly for the house, and leaving the trees in silhouette - that sense of exclusion wouldn''t be harmed by that, surely?', '2003-12-04 19:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(503978, 49364, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very well done, but obviously derivative, and why that title given the muted shades here? Yeah, it''s kind of green, but the whole world''s currency is not that shade necessarily ...</td>', 'Very well done, but obviously derivative, and why that title given the muted shades here? Yeah, it''s kind of green, but the whole world''s currency is not that shade necessarily ...', '2003-12-04 19:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(503979, 49013, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure is good- love the color. Composition feels crooked, I would prefer to see symmetry in architecture shots. Focus is good, lighting is even.<br/> <br/>Personal: To me the colors are the best thing about this photo. The subject fits the challenge but isn''t very creative.<br/> <br/>My vote: 5.</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure is good- love the color. Composition feels crooked, I would prefer to see symmetry in architecture shots. Focus is good, lighting is even. Personal: To me the colors are the best thing about this photo. The subject fits the challenge but isn''t very creative. My vote: 5.', '2003-12-04 19:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(503981, 49352, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure looks just a tiny bit too bright. Composition is relatively good if maybe a little too busy. Focus is good. Lighting is even.<br/> <br/>Personal: Good idea, perhaps shot a few more ways would yield a stronger photo.<br/> <br/>My vote: 4.</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure looks just a tiny bit too bright. Composition is relatively good if maybe a little too busy. Focus is good. Lighting is even. Personal: Good idea, perhaps shot a few more ways would yield a stronger photo. My vote: 4.', '2003-12-04 19:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(503983, 49029, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure is good, composition... not sure about the angle. Another might be stronger? Focus looks off. Lighting looks flat and perhaps could have been diffused to avoid the spots on the face.<br/> <br/>Personal: Doesn''t look particularly creative or like much time was spent.<br/> <br/>My vote: 2.</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure is good, composition... not sure about the angle. Another might be stronger? Focus looks off. Lighting looks flat and perhaps could have been diffused to avoid the spots on the face. Personal: Doesn''t look particularly creative or like much time was spent. My vote: 2.', '2003-12-04 19:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(503986, 48854, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good.<br/> <br/>Personal: Creativity would be the only issue here. <br/> <br/>My vote: 4.</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good. Personal: Creativity would be the only issue here.  My vote: 4.', '2003-12-04 19:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(503988, 49393, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure is good, composition feels a little bottom heavy and the bottle rolled just slightly to the left kinda bugs me. The background is interesting but maybe too busy considering the subject itself is pretty busy. Focus is good. I''d like to see the lighting a little better controlled, you''ve got reflections and hot spots all over the bottle.<br/> <br/>Personal: Creative idea, maybe a little over done. More shots with better diffusion on the lights might have yielded stronger shots.<br/> <br/>My vote: 5</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure is good, composition feels a little bottom heavy and the bottle rolled just slightly to the left kinda bugs me. The background is interesting but maybe too busy considering the subject itself is pretty busy. Focus is good. I''d like to see the lighting a little better controlled, you''ve got reflections and hot spots all over the bottle. Personal: Creative idea, maybe a little over done. More shots with better diffusion on the lights might have yielded stronger shots. My vote: 5', '2003-12-04 19:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(503992, 49409, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge very well. Exposure composition focus lighting are all excellent. Technically I think it''s great!<br/> <br/>Personal: I definitely equate a lens like that with jewels and fur- made me laugh. I like this shot all around.<br/> <br/>My vote: 8</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge very well. Exposure composition focus lighting are all excellent. Technically I think it''s great! Personal: I definitely equate a lens like that with jewels and fur- made me laugh. I like this shot all around. My vote: 8', '2003-12-04 19:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(503994, 49207, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure good, composition too left heavy for my taste, focus good, lighting too harsh for me.<br/> <br/>Personal: Banks (bricks and mortar, piggy, and all other types) seem an obvious choice for this challenge. The lines between overdone, perfect fit, and too "out there" are really fuzzy in a lot of cases. I like the shot but I don''t go "wow".<br/> <br/>My vote: 5</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure good, composition too left heavy for my taste, focus good, lighting too harsh for me. Personal: Banks (bricks and mortar, piggy, and all other types) seem an obvious choice for this challenge. The lines between overdone, perfect fit, and too "out there" are really fuzzy in a lot of cases. I like the shot but I don''t go "wow". My vote: 5', '2003-12-04 19:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(503997, 49160, 327, '<td valign="top">These poor folks are on every corner here. Many with the same sign. Really. I wouldn''t want to trade lives with them. Good idea for the challenge. Good luck.</td>', 'These poor folks are on every corner here. Many with the same sign. Really. I wouldn''t want to trade lives with them. Good idea for the challenge. Good luck.', '2003-12-04 19:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(504000, 49342, 327, '<td valign="top">Really good idea for the challenge. I think your composition needed a bit more thought. &lt;The background&gt; The shot is well focused and the colors are good. The light is a little bit harsh, but not too bad. Good idea.</td>', 'Really good idea for the challenge. I think your composition needed a bit more thought. <The background> The shot is well focused and the colors are good. The light is a little bit harsh, but not too bad. Good idea.', '2003-12-04 19:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(504001, 48859, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: You already know you didn''t read the rules. Underexposed. Composition is okay. Focus good. Lighting- needs more.<br/> <br/>Personal: Marginal creativity. <br/> <br/>My vote: 1</td>', 'Technical: You already know you didn''t read the rules. Underexposed. Composition is okay. Focus good. Lighting- needs more. Personal: Marginal creativity.  My vote: 1', '2003-12-04 19:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(504007, 49362, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure is tough with neon- you''re a little underdone on the room itself and a little hot on the machines and the neon. I like the composition. Not sure where the focus is. Lighting is so so.<br/> <br/>Personal: Not overly creative. I''m surprised by the lack of people! Some "ghosts" in the extended exposure might have made this more interesting.<br/> <br/>My vote: 4</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure is tough with neon- you''re a little underdone on the room itself and a little hot on the machines and the neon. I like the composition. Not sure where the focus is. Lighting is so so. Personal: Not overly creative. I''m surprised by the lack of people! Some "ghosts" in the extended exposure might have made this more interesting. My vote: 4', '2003-12-04 19:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(504009, 49284, 327, '<td valign="top">Jewelery is one of the hardest things to shoot. The light goes nuts on ya and the composition can be difficult.The veiw here doesn''t add to the pretty ring. Nice try and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Jewelery is one of the hardest things to shoot. The light goes nuts on ya and the composition can be difficult.The veiw here doesn''t add to the pretty ring. Nice try and good luck in the challenge.', '2003-12-04 19:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(504010, 49269, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure/lighting looks good but maybe a little hot on the pages. Composition is nice, but the spotting on the background is a little distracting. I hate not being able to spot edit! :-) Focus good.<br/> <br/>Personal: I like it! <br/> <br/>My vote: 6</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure/lighting looks good but maybe a little hot on the pages. Composition is nice, but the spotting on the background is a little distracting. I hate not being able to spot edit! :-) Focus good. Personal: I like it!  My vote: 6', '2003-12-04 19:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(504011, 49374, 327, '<td valign="top">Not unless ya got a money tree in the back yard!! :) Shot is a wee bit dark, but good try and your on topic for the challenge. Good luck.</td>', 'Not unless ya got a money tree in the back yard!! :) Shot is a wee bit dark, but good try and your on topic for the challenge. Good luck.', '2003-12-04 19:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(504014, 49401, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure/lighting good, both fit the subject well.  composition is nice. Focus- the DOF is a bit too shallow for me! Also the main diamond appearing to be a bit fuzzy is distracting.<br/> <br/>Personal: Creativity is there. Is this just equating jewelry with money or are you making a statement about marriage being costly? ;-)<br/> <br/>My vote: 7.</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure/lighting good, both fit the subject well.  composition is nice. Focus- the DOF is a bit too shallow for me! Also the main diamond appearing to be a bit fuzzy is distracting. Personal: Creativity is there. Is this just equating jewelry with money or are you making a statement about marriage being costly? ;-) My vote: 7.', '2003-12-04 19:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
