(504098, 49417, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all pretty good, though sorta uninteresting. <br/> <br/>Personal: You put some thought into this, and that''s good. I would have liked to see it more creatively shot.<br/> <br/>My vote: 5<br/> <br/></td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all pretty good, though sorta uninteresting.  Personal: You put some thought into this, and that''s good. I would have liked to see it more creatively shot. My vote: 5 ', '2003-12-04 21:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(504100, 49213, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good, but the apparent "wetness" is distracting.<br/> <br/>Personal: Creative, interesting to look at.<br/> <br/>My vote: 6<br/> <br/></td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good, but the apparent "wetness" is distracting. Personal: Creative, interesting to look at. My vote: 6 ', '2003-12-04 21:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(504103, 49073, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all very well done<br/> <br/>Personal: Much more creative presentation than other shots of the same subject in the challenge. Thank you for the effort!<br/> <br/>My vote: 8<br/> <br/></td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all very well done Personal: Much more creative presentation than other shots of the same subject in the challenge. Thank you for the effort! My vote: 8 ', '2003-12-04 21:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(504104, 49282, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure/lighting is obviously to acheive effect, but in my mind it fails. Focus good, too hard to tell if composition is good or not.<br/> <br/>Personal: Creative but not well executed.<br/> <br/>My vote: 4<br/> <br/></td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure/lighting is obviously to acheive effect, but in my mind it fails. Focus good, too hard to tell if composition is good or not. Personal: Creative but not well executed. My vote: 4 ', '2003-12-04 21:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(504106, 49413, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good- overall nicely shot. <br/> <br/>Personal: I like it.<br/> <br/>My vote: 7<br/> <br/></td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good- overall nicely shot.  Personal: I like it. My vote: 7 ', '2003-12-04 21:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(504107, 49386, 14015, '<td valign="top">I like the viewpoint from which this was taken.  I don''t know if the pink lace was originally part of the bank, but if not - nice touch...</td>', 'I like the viewpoint from which this was taken.  I don''t know if the pink lace was originally part of the bank, but if not - nice touch...', '2003-12-04 21:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(504108, 49240, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus all good, lighting leaves something to be desired on the ring.<br/> <br/>Personal: Not overly creative given the number of jewelry and credit card submissions in this challenge, but well shot.<br/> <br/>My vote: 6<br/> <br/></td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus all good, lighting leaves something to be desired on the ring. Personal: Not overly creative given the number of jewelry and credit card submissions in this challenge, but well shot. My vote: 6 ', '2003-12-04 21:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(504112, 48912, 11073, '<td valign="top">i like the composition and the subject. the focus looks like - to me anyway - its on the a, 1, 2, "length" as opposed to the "closer" push for coin return button. as a result the "main" subject (at least i think the coin button should be the focul point) is blurry imo.  6.</td>', 'i like the composition and the subject. the focus looks like - to me anyway - its on the a, 1, 2, "length" as opposed to the "closer" push for coin return button. as a result the "main" subject (at least i think the coin button should be the focul point) is blurry imo.  6.', '2003-12-04 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(504113, 49140, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge only because of the title. Some actual prospecting in the shot would have strengthened that relationship. Exposure composition focus and lighting all excellent, beautiful photograph.<br/> <br/>Personal: Maybe it''s just me, but I don''t equate prospectors with milky blue water and fantasy type landscapes- to me this doesn''t fit the challenge.<br/> <br/>My vote: 5</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge only because of the title. Some actual prospecting in the shot would have strengthened that relationship. Exposure composition focus and lighting all excellent, beautiful photograph. Personal: Maybe it''s just me, but I don''t equate prospectors with milky blue water and fantasy type landscapes- to me this doesn''t fit the challenge. My vote: 5', '2003-12-04 21:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(504114, 48994, 14015, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped out the balcony in the bottom right corner and narrowed in on the bottom &amp; middle row only if it had been possible -- overall I like the photo...</td>', 'I think I would have cropped out the balcony in the bottom right corner and narrowed in on the bottom & middle row only if it had been possible -- overall I like the photo...', '2003-12-04 21:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(504115, 49388, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge well. Exposure composition focus and lighting all excellent, very compelling.<br/> <br/>Personal: Excellent job all around.<br/> <br/>My vote: 9<br/> <br/></td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge well. Exposure composition focus and lighting all excellent, very compelling. Personal: Excellent job all around. My vote: 9 ', '2003-12-04 21:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(504116, 49417, 14015, '<td valign="top">Very creative -- I like the "square-on" viewpoint.  The darker color (burgundy?) pulls you to the botom right, which to me invokes the rule of 1/3...very nice!</td>', 'Very creative -- I like the "square-on" viewpoint.  The darker color (burgundy?) pulls you to the botom right, which to me invokes the rule of 1/3...very nice!', '2003-12-04 21:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(504117, 49392, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge after a fashion- that takes some thought ;-). A little underexposed, composition fits the subject, focus is good, lighting is flat.<br/> <br/>Personal: Pretty creative, some might not get it. I think you''re reaching :-)<br/> <br/>My vote: 6<br/> <br/></td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge after a fashion- that takes some thought ;-). A little underexposed, composition fits the subject, focus is good, lighting is flat. Personal: Pretty creative, some might not get it. I think you''re reaching :-) My vote: 6 ', '2003-12-04 21:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(504119, 48795, 11073, '<td valign="top">my only suggestion would be to crop out the scenery to the right of the building - it distracts my eye from the main subject imo.  just a thought.  nice, dark, moody pic to convey your point.</td>', 'my only suggestion would be to crop out the scenery to the right of the building - it distracts my eye from the main subject imo.  just a thought.  nice, dark, moody pic to convey your point.', '2003-12-04 21:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(504120, 48889, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: You already know you broke the rules. Exposure composition focus lighting all good, technically well shot. <br/> <br/>My vote: 1<br/> <br/></td>', 'Technical: You already know you broke the rules. Exposure composition focus lighting all good, technically well shot.  My vote: 1 ', '2003-12-04 21:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(504121, 49327, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge well. Exposure composition focus lighting all excellent<br/> <br/>Personal: Very creative way to shoot a common subject in this challenge- nicely done!<br/> <br/>My vote: 8<br/> <br/></td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge well. Exposure composition focus lighting all excellent Personal: Very creative way to shoot a common subject in this challenge- nicely done! My vote: 8 ', '2003-12-04 21:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(504123, 49397, 14015, '<td valign="top">I like the arrangement, cards fanning from the coinpeice.  Great shot!</td>', 'I like the arrangement, cards fanning from the coinpeice.  Great shot!', '2003-12-04 21:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(504133, 49091, 14015, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Definitely says, "money" and I like the macro view...</td>', 'Nice.  Definitely says, "money" and I like the macro view...', '2003-12-04 21:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(504134, 49347, 14015, '<td valign="top">Nice imagery.  I almost missed the "hammer" in the shadow --</td>', 'Nice imagery.  I almost missed the "hammer" in the shadow --', '2003-12-04 21:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(504137, 49127, 14015, '<td valign="top">The branch on the left is just ''in the way'' -- like the contrast of the sharp green of the grass and strong blue of the sky.  Just that pesky branch =)</td>', 'The branch on the left is just ''in the way'' -- like the contrast of the sharp green of the grass and strong blue of the sky.  Just that pesky branch =)', '2003-12-04 21:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(504139, 49401, 11241, '<td valign="top">Very nice set of rings...and i love the way they fade away into the background...10</td>', 'Very nice set of rings...and i love the way they fade away into the background...10', '2003-12-04 21:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(504141, 49345, 11241, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, just maybe needs to be a bit clearer.....sharper maybe...9</td>', 'Very nice shot, just maybe needs to be a bit clearer.....sharper maybe...9', '2003-12-04 21:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(504142, 49159, 14015, '<td valign="top">The motion of the hand may have been intentional, but I think "still" would have been more appealing.  I like the close-up on the cards - nice &amp; bright...<br/></td>', 'The motion of the hand may have been intentional, but I think "still" would have been more appealing.  I like the close-up on the cards - nice & bright...', '2003-12-04 21:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(504143, 49413, 14015, '<td valign="top">I like the "informal" feel of this one: used cliip, scratched desk, crumpled ticket...very nice.</td>', 'I like the "informal" feel of this one: used cliip, scratched desk, crumpled ticket...very nice.', '2003-12-04 21:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(504145, 49152, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and focus, but colors a bit dull...<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice lighting and focus, but colors a bit dull...TC', '2003-12-04 22:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(504149, 49401, 9906, '<td valign="top">DOF is way to shallow for this type of image (IMHO).  Also the high key approach doesn''t do this justice...<br/>TC</td>', 'DOF is way to shallow for this type of image (IMHO).  Also the high key approach doesn''t do this justice...TC', '2003-12-04 22:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(504153, 49009, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don\''t get the connection between the image, the title, and the challenge...  On a technical note, the uneveness of your light source is a bit distracting.<br/>TC</td>', 'I don\''t get the connection between the image, the title, and the challenge...  On a technical note, the uneveness of your light source is a bit distracting.TC', '2003-12-04 22:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(504155, 49430, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Good colors.  The DOF is a touch shallow for my taste for this type of shot.  Also the multiple shadows detracts.  Oh and I''m a coke drinker! :-P<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice shot.  Good colors.  The DOF is a touch shallow for my taste for this type of shot.  Also the multiple shadows detracts.  Oh and I''m a coke drinker! :-PTC', '2003-12-04 22:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(504158, 48854, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the sign, but you are suffering terribly from under exposure.  Way too dark for Vegas!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice focus on the sign, but you are suffering terribly from under exposure.  Way too dark for Vegas!TC', '2003-12-04 22:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(504159, 49037, 14015, '<td valign="top">From that view it does look like a pool instead of a window --  Great idea!</td>', 'From that view it does look like a pool instead of a window --  Great idea!', '2003-12-04 22:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(504164, 49124, 10275, '<td valign="top">This just cracked me up. Love your title. Good shot of your baby.</td>', 'This just cracked me up. Love your title. Good shot of your baby.', '2003-12-04 22:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(504165, 49392, 9906, '<td valign="top">Funny!  And tricky.  Unfortunately you don''t have anywhere near enough light.  You are soft on focus, dull on color and flat.  All can be fixed with LIGHT!<br/>TC</td>', 'Funny!  And tricky.  Unfortunately you don''t have anywhere near enough light.  You are soft on focus, dull on color and flat.  All can be fixed with LIGHT!TC', '2003-12-04 22:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(504168, 49071, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great expression!  Nice lighting, but you could use a touch of fill on his left shoulder.  The kid looks like the ''not'', but the ''have'' ain''t got enough to make this shot.  Also I don''t comment often on  borders, but the triple one here IS distracting.<br/>TC</td>', 'Great expression!  Nice lighting, but you could use a touch of fill on his left shoulder.  The kid looks like the ''not'', but the ''have'' ain''t got enough to make this shot.  Also I don''t comment often on  borders, but the triple one here IS distracting.TC', '2003-12-04 22:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(504169, 49355, 10275, '<td valign="top">I can''t stop laughing, this is so funny. As for the quality, it could be rotated clockwise a bit, and I am missing some other colour for a touch of contrast. But clever title for sure.</td>', 'I can''t stop laughing, this is so funny. As for the quality, it could be rotated clockwise a bit, and I am missing some other colour for a touch of contrast. But clever title for sure.', '2003-12-04 22:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(504170, 49003, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t see ANY connection with money here.  There is nothing to ''focus'' on because there is no focus.  The frame is overbearing.<br/>TC</td>', 'I don''t see ANY connection with money here.  There is nothing to ''focus'' on because there is no focus.  The frame is overbearing.TC', '2003-12-04 22:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(504171, 49328, 14015, '<td valign="top">I like your catching the \"deal\" in motion, and to me, the b/w effect adds class.  Excellent!</td>', 'I like your catching the \"deal\" in motion, and to me, the b/w effect adds class.  Excellent!', '2003-12-04 22:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(504172, 48933, 14015, '<td valign="top">I like both the tilt of the subject and the water beads...great shot!</td>', 'I like both the tilt of the subject and the water beads...great shot!', '2003-12-04 22:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(504174, 48841, 10275, '<td valign="top">I do not understand your photo and how it relates to the challenge. I also do not know what your title means. Your photo is pretty good, sharp and clean, just don''t know what to make of it. Can you perhaps explain?</td>', 'I do not understand your photo and how it relates to the challenge. I also do not know what your title means. Your photo is pretty good, sharp and clean, just don''t know what to make of it. Can you perhaps explain?', '2003-12-04 22:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(504177, 49351, 1379, '<td valign="top">I want to trade place with you!!!  What an amazing vista you got to enjoy!  I love the deep shadows and the glowing whites.  Awesome!</td>', 'I want to trade place with you!!!  What an amazing vista you got to enjoy!  I love the deep shadows and the glowing whites.  Awesome!', '2003-12-04 22:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(504180, 49317, 10275, '<td valign="top">Show off!  Just kidding :-))  What did you take this shot with? It''s a bit soft, not as focused as I would expect. Also I don''t think the black background is working here very well. You need more colour to make this more interesting.</td>', 'Show off!  Just kidding :-))  What did you take this shot with? It''s a bit soft, not as focused as I would expect. Also I don''t think the black background is working here very well. You need more colour to make this more interesting.', '2003-12-04 22:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(504181, 49392, 1379, '<td valign="top">It works!  You really put some thought into this photo.</td>', 'It works!  You really put some thought into this photo.', '2003-12-04 22:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(504185, 48999, 10275, '<td valign="top">I sure hope these are not real cards, cause you can read all the numbers and a name on it. You are very brave to post this online for everyone to see. Nice vivid colours.</td>', 'I sure hope these are not real cards, cause you can read all the numbers and a name on it. You are very brave to post this online for everyone to see. Nice vivid colours.', '2003-12-04 22:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(504221, 49392, 509, '<td valign="top">lol, very interesting. creative interpretation of the challenge.  Seems a little low in contrast, maybe playing with levels and such would give more life to the subjects.</td>', 'lol, very interesting. creative interpretation of the challenge.  Seems a little low in contrast, maybe playing with levels and such would give more life to the subjects.', '2003-12-04 23:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(504223, 49379, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of taking a picture of a shop window, but there really isn''t much of interest in this window.  It looks like a shoe store based on the background, - a more glamorous (ie, pricey) store window might get the point across a little better.</td>', 'I like the idea of taking a picture of a shop window, but there really isn''t much of interest in this window.  It looks like a shoe store based on the background, - a more glamorous (ie, pricey) store window might get the point across a little better.', '2003-12-04 23:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(504227, 49140, 509, '<td valign="top">Where is the prospecting?  Having someone panning in the river would do well to tell the story without the title here.  It is a lovely scene, but depends completely on the title to relate to money.</td>', 'Where is the prospecting?  Having someone panning in the river would do well to tell the story without the title here.  It is a lovely scene, but depends completely on the title to relate to money.', '2003-12-04 23:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(504229, 49109, 9411, '<td valign="top">Points for being the only one doing this!  Absolutely love it. The background is great, really adds to the shot.  Do wish the cabbage on the left was a little sharper.<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'Points for being the only one doing this!  Absolutely love it. The background is great, really adds to the shot.  Do wish the cabbage on the left was a little sharper. 8', '2003-12-04 23:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(504231, 49347, 9411, '<td valign="top">Very funny. I like the expression on the pig!  8</td>', 'Very funny. I like the expression on the pig!  8', '2003-12-04 23:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(504234, 49207, 9411, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white.  I just purchased one of these for my mothers holiday present for her cash register. I like the composition alot. The use of mininmal light also works well, I think.  9</td>', 'Nice black and white.  I just purchased one of these for my mothers holiday present for her cash register. I like the composition alot. The use of mininmal light also works well, I think.  9', '2003-12-04 23:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(504235, 49212, 9411, '<td valign="top">This is a really good shot. Too bad it''s money.   6 for technical merit. Sorry.</td>', 'This is a really good shot. Too bad it''s money.   6 for technical merit. Sorry.', '2003-12-04 23:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(504274, 49347, 14522, '<td valign="top">Superb. Nice mix of shadow to create the anxiety.</td>', 'Superb. Nice mix of shadow to create the anxiety.', '2003-12-05 01:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(504275, 49365, 14522, '<td valign="top">Seems very flat. I don''t make the connection with the topic either.</td>', 'Seems very flat. I don''t make the connection with the topic either.', '2003-12-05 01:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(504276, 49241, 14522, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of reflections causing little hots spots. The reference is lost on me.</td>', 'There are a lot of reflections causing little hots spots. The reference is lost on me.', '2003-12-05 01:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(504278, 49366, 14522, '<td valign="top">Obviously set up - not that that is wrong but the image could have been cropped a lot tighter.</td>', 'Obviously set up - not that that is wrong but the image could have been cropped a lot tighter.', '2003-12-05 01:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(504279, 49429, 14522, '<td valign="top">Perhaps eveness of the light reflection on the writing could add. The odd thing in the bottom right is distracting. Nice even tone in the red though.</td>', 'Perhaps eveness of the light reflection on the writing could add. The odd thing in the bottom right is distracting. Nice even tone in the red though.', '2003-12-05 01:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(504280, 49067, 14522, '<td valign="top">There sems to be a cast. Perhaps your white balance is out? I think that you have caused of DOF problem for yourself by not having the newspaper completely flat. Studio work requires a huge amount of attention to detail.</td>', 'There sems to be a cast. Perhaps your white balance is out? I think that you have caused of DOF problem for yourself by not having the newspaper completely flat. Studio work requires a huge amount of attention to detail.', '2003-12-05 01:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(504281, 49003, 11073, '<td valign="top">i love it - i also like trying to figure out what you meant - my guess is that you are trying to say that your hands are money (as in the slang reference) - or a more literal meaning of - can''t make money without your hands.  Am I even close? =`)  8.</td>', 'i love it - i also like trying to figure out what you meant - my guess is that you are trying to say that your hands are money (as in the slang reference) - or a more literal meaning of - can''t make money without your hands.  Am I even close? =`)  8.', '2003-12-05 01:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(504282, 49149, 14522, '<td valign="top">Some of the cropping is fine but there is a strnage balck thing near the Queen. Your lighting drops off in the top right corner - perhaps some vigneting or something causing a shadow from your flash.</td>', 'Some of the cropping is fine but there is a strnage balck thing near the Queen. Your lighting drops off in the top right corner - perhaps some vigneting or something causing a shadow from your flash.', '2003-12-05 01:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(504284, 49257, 14522, '<td valign="top">There is a slight focus problem - probably from a long exposure. The other issue I have is that it is basically a picture of words, there is nothing in the composition for me.</td>', 'There is a slight focus problem - probably from a long exposure. The other issue I have is that it is basically a picture of words, there is nothing in the composition for me.', '2003-12-05 01:31:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(504285, 49408, 11073, '<td valign="top">that''s awesome - you must''ve shot yourself in the chest and thrown the gun - a head shot would not have allowed your muscles to throw the gun that far or better yet at all.  but who cares - I''m just happy I''m not looking at a piggy banks ;)  nice work. 8.</td>', 'that''s awesome - you must''ve shot yourself in the chest and thrown the gun - a head shot would not have allowed your muscles to throw the gun that far or better yet at all.  but who cares - I''m just happy I''m not looking at a piggy banks ;)  nice work. 8.', '2003-12-05 01:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(504286, 49273, 14522, '<td valign="top">The reference is completely lost on me. That aside, the foreground is not adding to the image at all.</td>', 'The reference is completely lost on me. That aside, the foreground is not adding to the image at all.', '2003-12-05 01:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(504287, 49427, 14522, '<td valign="top">There is DOF problem. The iamge is not capturing the lustre of gold and the crop is distracting. I mean why only on the right? I would also suggest that this is more about iron pyrite (Fool''s gold) and diamonds.</td>', 'There is DOF problem. The iamge is not capturing the lustre of gold and the crop is distracting. I mean why only on the right? I would also suggest that this is more about iron pyrite (Fool''s gold) and diamonds.', '2003-12-05 01:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(504288, 48997, 14522, '<td valign="top">This was set up so there is no excuse for the line through the S not being 100% straight. I think that if you could have have a desert background you may have had a superb expression. Cross culturally you lose quite a bit. I agree that the whole bottled water thing is ridiculous though.</td>', 'This was set up so there is no excuse for the line through the S not being 100% straight. I think that if you could have have a desert background you may have had a superb expression. Cross culturally you lose quite a bit. I agree that the whole bottled water thing is ridiculous though.', '2003-12-05 01:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(504289, 49386, 14522, '<td valign="top">I think you are let down a bit by the angle you chose. Your flash has crated the odd hot spot reflections and the shadows on your background are not particulary pleasing. Nice DOF and focus.</td>', 'I think you are let down a bit by the angle you chose. Your flash has crated the odd hot spot reflections and the shadows on your background are not particulary pleasing. Nice DOF and focus.', '2003-12-05 01:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(504290, 49381, 14522, '<td valign="top">Sharpness is an issue. Perhaps the same idea on an older or more weathered hand would work better.</td>', 'Sharpness is an issue. Perhaps the same idea on an older or more weathered hand would work better.', '2003-12-05 01:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(504292, 48933, 14522, '<td valign="top">One slight criticism. Just a bit too tigh against the left hand border otherwise great.</td>', 'One slight criticism. Just a bit too tigh against the left hand border otherwise great.', '2003-12-05 01:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(504293, 49339, 14522, '<td valign="top">There is a major problem here. The range of exposure that you are trying to accomodate is just too much with the result that the shadows are too dark and the highlights too light. Try this. Set up using a tripod. Take an image exposed for the shadows and then one exposed for the highlight. You can then merge the two and you''ll have an image that caters for the full dynamic range.</td>', 'There is a major problem here. The range of exposure that you are trying to accomodate is just too much with the result that the shadows are too dark and the highlights too light. Try this. Set up using a tripod. Take an image exposed for the shadows and then one exposed for the highlight. You can then merge the two and you''ll have an image that caters for the full dynamic range.', '2003-12-05 01:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(504294, 49282, 14522, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this is way too dark for me.</td>', 'Sorry but this is way too dark for me.', '2003-12-05 01:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
