(504509, 49396, 12733, '<td valign="top">Yes, and with the energy bill the Senate recently rejected, power is money - lots of it in tax breaks and incentives. I like the golden cast on this photo, and you caught a great sky.</td>', 'Yes, and with the energy bill the Senate recently rejected, power is money - lots of it in tax breaks and incentives. I like the golden cast on this photo, and you caught a great sky.', '2003-12-05 11:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
