(504512, 49356, 12733, '<td valign="top">Is this a ring, a bracelet or a belt? There''s nothing to show the scale. Nice colors, textures and shine. I like your background - it seems to have a pile like a carpet.</td>', 'Is this a ring, a bracelet or a belt? There''s nothing to show the scale. Nice colors, textures and shine. I like your background - it seems to have a pile like a carpet.', '2003-12-05 11:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
