(504548, 49405, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but I think it needs more depth of field.</td>', 'Nice concept, but I think it needs more depth of field.', '2003-12-05 11:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(504550, 49015, 12733, '<td valign="top">You didn''t need the long title - a gold Rolex says money all by itself. Nice capture on the shine of the gold and the detail of the watch face.</td>', 'You didn''t need the long title - a gold Rolex says money all by itself. Nice capture on the shine of the gold and the detail of the watch face.', '2003-12-05 11:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(504553, 48741, 12733, '<td valign="top">There are times when sections of a photo should be out of focus or underexposed for effect, but IMHO it doesn\''t really work in this one. I''d like to have seen more depth of field and more even exposure.</td>', 'There are times when sections of a photo should be out of focus or underexposed for effect, but IMHO it doesn\''t really work in this one. I''d like to have seen more depth of field and more even exposure.', '2003-12-05 11:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(504554, 49009, 327, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get what the @ sign has to do with $$ signs. :) The shot is okay but the foucs is a bit soft. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t really get what the @ sign has to do with $$ signs. :) The shot is okay but the foucs is a bit soft. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-12-05 11:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(504560, 48994, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a high angle to get a sense of the overall scene. I also like the colored lights on the machines. I would guess there''s another light source as well, from the colors on the figures. I like the intent expressions on the people.</td>', 'Nice use of a high angle to get a sense of the overall scene. I also like the colored lights on the machines. I would guess there''s another light source as well, from the colors on the figures. I like the intent expressions on the people.', '2003-12-05 11:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(504561, 49151, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but the background looks cluttered and draws attention from the main subject.</td>', 'Nice concept, but the background looks cluttered and draws attention from the main subject.', '2003-12-05 11:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(504562, 49163, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Makes its point well.</td>', 'Nice composition. Makes its point well.', '2003-12-05 11:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(504563, 49273, 12733, '<td valign="top">The perspective is great, it seems three-dimensional.</td>', 'The perspective is great, it seems three-dimensional.', '2003-12-05 11:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(504564, 49327, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting, closeup and choice of the car as a piece. I think the stack of hotels is a bit much - it is unnatural on a Monopoly board.</td>', 'Interesting lighting, closeup and choice of the car as a piece. I think the stack of hotels is a bit much - it is unnatural on a Monopoly board.', '2003-12-05 11:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(504565, 49298, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but I think it needs more clarity. The dark area at the right begins to overwhelm the subject matter.</td>', 'Nice concept, but I think it needs more clarity. The dark area at the right begins to overwhelm the subject matter.', '2003-12-05 11:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(504567, 49278, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene and reflections. Looks almost like a painting.</td>', 'Beautiful scene and reflections. Looks almost like a painting.', '2003-12-05 11:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(504569, 48795, 12733, '<td valign="top">Good rendition of an ugly building. What was it in its better days?</td>', 'Good rendition of an ugly building. What was it in its better days?', '2003-12-05 11:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(504571, 49160, 12733, '<td valign="top">Is this for real, or posed? Either he''s an honest guy, or this is a very un compassionate statement about the down and out.</td>', 'Is this for real, or posed? Either he''s an honest guy, or this is a very un compassionate statement about the down and out.', '2003-12-05 11:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(504572, 49421, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, great sky, good light. I like the way you''ve cropped this to a panoramic effect - it brings out the sense of a long row of buildings. But where''s the boardwalk?????</td>', 'Nice composition, great sky, good light. I like the way you''ve cropped this to a panoramic effect - it brings out the sense of a long row of buildings. But where''s the boardwalk?????', '2003-12-05 11:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(504574, 48896, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great study of the play of light on metal.</td>', 'Great study of the play of light on metal.', '2003-12-05 11:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(504577, 49245, 12733, '<td valign="top">Safest would be to cut them up first. IMHO you''re too close up, it took me too long to figure out what the cards are lying in - I guessed at an ashtray, a plastic tray and a sink before I figured out the meaning of the photo. If I had been busier today, I wouldn''t have bothered and rated it very low.</td>', 'Safest would be to cut them up first. IMHO you''re too close up, it took me too long to figure out what the cards are lying in - I guessed at an ashtray, a plastic tray and a sink before I figured out the meaning of the photo. If I had been busier today, I wouldn''t have bothered and rated it very low.', '2003-12-05 12:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
