(505180, 49289, 5158, '<td valign="top">One of my few favorits! Like the composition, the light and that the backround is not completely dark. Using color instead of B&amp;W works well to, although the fingers are a little too saturated IMO. Good luck</td>', 'One of my few favorits! Like the composition, the light and that the backround is not completely dark. Using color instead of B&W works well to, although the fingers are a little too saturated IMO. Good luck', '2003-12-06 03:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(505233, 49364, 4008, '<td valign="top">An idea seen many times before (I did it as well). Execution is o.k. but some drops show refractions of the surroundings, very clearly visible in the top left area. Should have shielded the surroundings or play with the size of, and distance to the paper.</td>', 'An idea seen many times before (I did it as well). Execution is o.k. but some drops show refractions of the surroundings, very clearly visible in the top left area. Should have shielded the surroundings or play with the size of, and distance to the paper.', '2003-12-06 09:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(505235, 49003, 4008, '<td valign="top">I have no clue how this depicts money.</td>', 'I have no clue how this depicts money.', '2003-12-06 09:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(505238, 49140, 4008, '<td valign="top">Love the gold colors on the rocks, good idea. But the branch is really disturbing. I would have chosen a different position if possible, but even the image as it is now can be improved by cropping the branch away.</td>', 'Love the gold colors on the rocks, good idea. But the branch is really disturbing. I would have chosen a different position if possible, but even the image as it is now can be improved by cropping the branch away.', '2003-12-06 09:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(505244, 49405, 4008, '<td valign="top">The idea is fine. The color of light is nice and warm. But the image is so unsharp everywhere. And the needles of the tree don''t fit in.</td>', 'The idea is fine. The color of light is nice and warm. But the image is so unsharp everywhere. And the needles of the tree don''t fit in.', '2003-12-06 09:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(505248, 49287, 4008, '<td valign="top">Wow, an 8 second exposure ? Some shiny area''s are burned out. The setup is nothing particularly special. A picture of a watch on a table, which gives me a feeling I have to tilt my head to view the watch properly. A different view, a different background might have added some more class to it, some more expression of money.</td>', 'Wow, an 8 second exposure ? Some shiny area''s are burned out. The setup is nothing particularly special. A picture of a watch on a table, which gives me a feeling I have to tilt my head to view the watch properly. A different view, a different background might have added some more class to it, some more expression of money.', '2003-12-06 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(505249, 49370, 4008, '<td valign="top">The image is very unsharp.</td>', 'The image is very unsharp.', '2003-12-06 09:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(505250, 49402, 4008, '<td valign="top">Love the color combination. But the watch on the right is too dark for my taste, the left one draws more attention, feels out of balance.</td>', 'Love the color combination. But the watch on the right is too dark for my taste, the left one draws more attention, feels out of balance.', '2003-12-06 10:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(505252, 49351, 4008, '<td valign="top">great image, but without the title it does not express money to me.</td>', 'great image, but without the title it does not express money to me.', '2003-12-06 10:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(505254, 49034, 4008, '<td valign="top">Such a stationary object should be sharp. I can see you used a long exposure, did you use a tripod ?</td>', 'Such a stationary object should be sharp. I can see you used a long exposure, did you use a tripod ?', '2003-12-06 10:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(505256, 49284, 4008, '<td valign="top">The stone and the ring should be sharp. Sharpness is now on the hand.</td>', 'The stone and the ring should be sharp. Sharpness is now on the hand.', '2003-12-06 10:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(505263, 49427, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like the color of the light and the uniform tones. Good sharpness as well. Some burned out areas on the ring, and the stones is really competing for attention.</td>', 'I like the color of the light and the uniform tones. Good sharpness as well. Some burned out areas on the ring, and the stones is really competing for attention.', '2003-12-06 10:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(505265, 49342, 4008, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Execution could be improved : for example by paying more attention to the background, light area on the left, dark area on the right, with painting or door ? Should be equal and not drawing attention away.</td>', 'Good idea. Execution could be improved : for example by paying more attention to the background, light area on the left, dark area on the right, with painting or door ? Should be equal and not drawing attention away.', '2003-12-06 10:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(505275, 49252, 4008, '<td valign="top">Good idea and very well executed, sharp, good light, good composition. Could maybe cut some of the top of the image away. In my top 3 for this challenge.</td>', 'Good idea and very well executed, sharp, good light, good composition. Could maybe cut some of the top of the image away. In my top 3 for this challenge.', '2003-12-06 10:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(505281, 49065, 4008, '<td valign="top">Simple but very effective. Possibly even stronger when seen straight from the front and then the top line cut away.</td>', 'Simple but very effective. Possibly even stronger when seen straight from the front and then the top line cut away.', '2003-12-06 10:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(505282, 49419, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great idea and really expresses money, or a need for money, to me.</td>', 'Great idea and really expresses money, or a need for money, to me.', '2003-12-06 10:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(505287, 49260, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great idea and very well executed. In my top 5 for this challenge. In Holland they say you have a hole in your hand, when you are spending to much money. Maybe for next time ?</td>', 'Great idea and very well executed. In my top 5 for this challenge. In Holland they say you have a hole in your hand, when you are spending to much money. Maybe for next time ?', '2003-12-06 10:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(505289, 49401, 4008, '<td valign="top">The soft tones are terrific, good use of depth of field, nice clean composition. I am missing a sparkle in the diamonds. Still in my top 5 for this challenge.</td>', 'The soft tones are terrific, good use of depth of field, nice clean composition. I am missing a sparkle in the diamonds. Still in my top 5 for this challenge.', '2003-12-06 10:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(505291, 49364, 8891, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail, think the green could have been a bit darker,  just a nit, but a 10 anyway.</td>', 'Excellent detail, think the green could have been a bit darker,  just a nit, but a 10 anyway.', '2003-12-06 10:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(505307, 49401, 5158, '<td valign="top">A great composition which fits the challenge very well. The use of a narrow DOF is well suited, however, maybe the DOF is a bit too narrow. Also the big diamond is a little too dark IMO. What works very well is the use of B&amp;W and how you made the frame. Good luck to you</td>', 'A great composition which fits the challenge very well. The use of a narrow DOF is well suited, however, maybe the DOF is a bit too narrow. Also the big diamond is a little too dark IMO. What works very well is the use of B&W and how you made the frame. Good luck to you', '2003-12-06 11:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(505309, 49150, 12902, '<td valign="top">I like the picture. Focus seems really soft. Have you take the picture through the glass? I still love it anyway and I still think it deserves a 10. So, 10 it is.</td>', 'I like the picture. Focus seems really soft. Have you take the picture through the glass? I still love it anyway and I still think it deserves a 10. So, 10 it is.', '2003-12-06 11:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(505311, 48996, 5158, '<td valign="top">A strong entry! While money would not be the first thing that if it were not in this challenge, I think it fits very well. Also showing a realistic scene rather then a technically brilliant work is well suited: adds a lot to the mood of the image. For me a 8.</td>', 'A strong entry! While money would not be the first thing that if it were not in this challenge, I think it fits very well. Also showing a realistic scene rather then a technically brilliant work is well suited: adds a lot to the mood of the image. For me a 8.', '2003-12-06 11:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(505312, 49071, 12902, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture... Running for the blue ribbon in my opinion. I like the lighting and the contrast you was able to achieve. Not only the rich-poor contrast, but also the light-shadow effect. Magnificent! 10.</td>', 'Excellent picture... Running for the blue ribbon in my opinion. I like the lighting and the contrast you was able to achieve. Not only the rich-poor contrast, but also the light-shadow effect. Magnificent! 10.', '2003-12-06 11:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(505313, 49302, 5158, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea to depict money of the past. I like the composition and the light. Good luck</td>', 'Brilliant idea to depict money of the past. I like the composition and the light. Good luck', '2003-12-06 11:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(505315, 49383, 5158, '<td valign="top">Good idea and well composed. Light is also set well. Only the DOF could be a little larger and the image more crisp.</td>', 'Good idea and well composed. Light is also set well. Only the DOF could be a little larger and the image more crisp.', '2003-12-06 11:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(505316, 49295, 12902, '<td valign="top">Nice looking stones. The light looks nice to me but you did the same mistake I did with my photo. Focus way too soft. But I still like it so 9 from me.</td>', 'Nice looking stones. The light looks nice to me but you did the same mistake I did with my photo. Focus way too soft. But I still like it so 9 from me.', '2003-12-06 11:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
