(505397, 49127, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love the title and the composition with the tree and the wall abutments. Thats really a fantastic angle to take a picture of a house. However- it occurs to me that scattered around chinese restaurants and laundromats are books and books full of house pictures. This one might say "large 15 room stone victorian mansion- 1.5 million."</td>', 'I love the title and the composition with the tree and the wall abutments. Thats really a fantastic angle to take a picture of a house. However- it occurs to me that scattered around chinese restaurants and laundromats are books and books full of house pictures. This one might say "large 15 room stone victorian mansion- 1.5 million."', '2003-12-06 14:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(505402, 48965, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like your style- this is no studio stock shot- this is interesting, creative, and semi-artsy. well done!</td>', 'I like your style- this is no studio stock shot- this is interesting, creative, and semi-artsy. well done!', '2003-12-06 14:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
