(505407, 49029, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the title, I like the angle. Never stop being quirky, I love it!</td>', 'I like the title, I like the angle. Never stop being quirky, I love it!', '2003-12-06 14:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(505409, 49354, 12611, '<td valign="top">The tones on ht ehand are spectacular- they almost look like an effect! That rainbow piggy bak is so distracting- I nice sensual shot of a women''s wrist is ruined.- used a stainless steel piggy bank amd make the shot black and white.  But nice try.</td>', 'The tones on ht ehand are spectacular- they almost look like an effect! That rainbow piggy bak is so distracting- I nice sensual shot of a women''s wrist is ruined.- used a stainless steel piggy bank amd make the shot black and white.  But nice try.', '2003-12-06 14:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(505411, 49013, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love the blue color and the white and brick red building. great angle, great perspective. You did the best you could with this subject- you nailed it, this is just short of perfect.</td>', 'I love the blue color and the white and brick red building. great angle, great perspective. You did the best you could with this subject- you nailed it, this is just short of perfect.', '2003-12-06 14:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(505412, 49355, 12611, '<td valign="top">wow. this is a bunch of toilets. I like it. I dig your irreverance. Screw the pretty subjects, nice composition and pleasing colors- lets show a bunch of crappers! well done!</td>', 'wow. this is a bunch of toilets. I like it. I dig your irreverance. Screw the pretty subjects, nice composition and pleasing colors- lets show a bunch of crappers! well done!', '2003-12-06 14:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(505413, 49302, 12611, '<td valign="top">The title need not be so explanatory, but the shot is nice. It is a tad contrived because of the obvious placement of items in the immediate forefront. I also might like a more uniform color scheme. The red beads look too much like seedless red grapes. The rest of the shot is so pleasingly sepia toned. And what the heck are you doing with all those traps?</td>', 'The title need not be so explanatory, but the shot is nice. It is a tad contrived because of the obvious placement of items in the immediate forefront. I also might like a more uniform color scheme. The red beads look too much like seedless red grapes. The rest of the shot is so pleasingly sepia toned. And what the heck are you doing with all those traps?', '2003-12-06 14:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(505417, 49054, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, crazy hippies!</td>', 'Nice colors, crazy hippies!', '2003-12-06 14:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(505419, 49376, 12611, '<td valign="top">Good contrast- nice "sony type colors" but is this really anything more than a "mickey mouse" shot?  :)</td>', 'Good contrast- nice "sony type colors" but is this really anything more than a "mickey mouse" shot?  :)', '2003-12-06 14:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(505420, 49397, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice shot- the lighting could be a wee bit cleaner- some washed out spots on the cards. But I like It- you are obviously alluding to the casino making the money.. right? or is this a dream?</td>', 'Nice shot- the lighting could be a wee bit cleaner- some washed out spots on the cards. But I like It- you are obviously alluding to the casino making the money.. right? or is this a dream?', '2003-12-06 14:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(505422, 49380, 12611, '<td valign="top">C''mon- this guy works in the parking lot next door. But seriously- the shot needs contrast.and sharpness/focus. I like the theme though.</td>', 'C''mon- this guy works in the parking lot next door. But seriously- the shot needs contrast.and sharpness/focus. I like the theme though.', '2003-12-06 14:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(505425, 48715, 12611, '<td valign="top">Everyone has said the following to you I am sure:<br/>The composition is busy, the picture is not sharp, the colors are muted and untrue, the focus could be better, the tablecloth is distracting, there is glare on the wallet, the shot is too small, give up photography, etc.<br/>That is because they are snooty, technical robot jerks. You have an honest, albeit, lowrent style here. The soft focus, even if unintentional, is nice. Just like fine lingerie enhances sensuality, you show just enough of the checkbook inside to tease- what is check 2401 for, a cable bill? who knows- but I like the lighting and shadow- you may finish last- but I''m giving you a high, albeit undisclosed, score.</td>', 'Everyone has said the following to you I am sure:The composition is busy, the picture is not sharp, the colors are muted and untrue, the focus could be better, the tablecloth is distracting, there is glare on the wallet, the shot is too small, give up photography, etc.That is because they are snooty, technical robot jerks. You have an honest, albeit, lowrent style here. The soft focus, even if unintentional, is nice. Just like fine lingerie enhances sensuality, you show just enough of the checkbook inside to tease- what is check 2401 for, a cable bill? who knows- but I like the lighting and shadow- you may finish last- but I''m giving you a high, albeit undisclosed, score.', '2003-12-06 14:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(505431, 49124, 12611, '<td valign="top">I ''m not sure what to think about this shot. THe crop gives me a headache, th edges are blurry, there is no attention to symmetry.and  I am immediately fighting off the distinct impression that this photo really really stinks. But it is a clever title, with a nice blue color and a sharp shot. I guess this shot is pretty pleasing really, I like the aftermarket webbed grill, and the fact that you managed to keep your self out of the reflection. It is my vote and I ultimately say... nice job.</td>', 'I ''m not sure what to think about this shot. THe crop gives me a headache, th edges are blurry, there is no attention to symmetry.and  I am immediately fighting off the distinct impression that this photo really really stinks. But it is a clever title, with a nice blue color and a sharp shot. I guess this shot is pretty pleasing really, I like the aftermarket webbed grill, and the fact that you managed to keep your self out of the reflection. It is my vote and I ultimately say... nice job.', '2003-12-06 14:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(505432, 48841, 12475, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, colors, lighting. I suspect some will question the connection to the challenge, but I like the way you tied it in with the title.</td>', 'Beautiful composition, colors, lighting. I suspect some will question the connection to the challenge, but I like the way you tied it in with the title.', '2003-12-06 14:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(505433, 49252, 12475, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2003-12-06 14:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(505434, 49408, 12475, '<td valign="top">This one took a second, but wow--has quite an impact. Nicely done, and certainly one of the more interesting responses to the challenge.</td>', 'This one took a second, but wow--has quite an impact. Nicely done, and certainly one of the more interesting responses to the challenge.', '2003-12-06 14:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(505436, 49426, 12475, '<td valign="top">Well done; has a stronger impact and message than other shots of credit cards.</td>', 'Well done; has a stronger impact and message than other shots of credit cards.', '2003-12-06 14:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(505439, 49002, 12475, '<td valign="top">This is very cute, and I like the story it tells. It''s a little hard to tell where she is, though.</td>', 'This is very cute, and I like the story it tells. It''s a little hard to tell where she is, though.', '2003-12-06 14:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(505440, 49037, 12475, '<td valign="top">Very nice, symmetrical shot and well lit; I like the choice of shooting at such a sharp upward angle, which conveys the imposing nature of the institution! <br/>:)</td>', 'Very nice, symmetrical shot and well lit; I like the choice of shooting at such a sharp upward angle, which conveys the imposing nature of the institution! :)', '2003-12-06 14:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(505441, 49260, 12475, '<td valign="top">Great, creative idea and shot well.</td>', 'Great, creative idea and shot well.', '2003-12-06 14:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(505442, 49289, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice light, expensive camera, but what makes the shot is the cuts and callouses on this guys on fingers. Nice detail. THe only thing that keeps this shot from being a ten is the overall "brown feeling" of the lighting, and the jaggie lines of contrast on the thumb and fingers</td>', 'Nice light, expensive camera, but what makes the shot is the cuts and callouses on this guys on fingers. Nice detail. THe only thing that keeps this shot from being a ten is the overall "brown feeling" of the lighting, and the jaggie lines of contrast on the thumb and fingers', '2003-12-06 14:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(505445, 49284, 12611, '<td valign="top">That is one ugly ring. Nice detail.</td>', 'That is one ugly ring. Nice detail.', '2003-12-06 14:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(505449, 48715, 12475, '<td valign="top">Small and out of focus; not much interest here, sorry.</td>', 'Small and out of focus; not much interest here, sorry.', '2003-12-06 14:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(505450, 49352, 12611, '<td valign="top">I think a hand model would improve the shot- but the lighting is nice, and you flirt on th eedge of "currency"</td>', 'I think a hand model would improve the shot- but the lighting is nice, and you flirt on th eedge of "currency"', '2003-12-06 14:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(505459, 49054, 13735, '<td valign="top">Very interesting... but far from MONEY as such, i''d say!</td>', 'Very interesting... but far from MONEY as such, i''d say!', '2003-12-06 15:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(505461, 49421, 13735, '<td valign="top">Nice concept! High 7.</td>', 'Nice concept! High 7.', '2003-12-06 15:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(505462, 49345, 13735, '<td valign="top">Quite an idea! We like it!</td>', 'Quite an idea! We like it!', '2003-12-06 15:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(505468, 49381, 13735, '<td valign="top">The hand is too clean... for your concept... I reckon!</td>', 'The hand is too clean... for your concept... I reckon!', '2003-12-06 15:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(505486, 48971, 13735, '<td valign="top">Against the rules...</td>', 'Against the rules...', '2003-12-06 15:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(505498, 48859, 13735, '<td valign="top">Against the rules, isn''t it?</td>', 'Against the rules, isn''t it?', '2003-12-06 15:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(505499, 49418, 8005, '<td valign="top">Excellent play on the theme.</td>', 'Excellent play on the theme.', '2003-12-06 15:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(505500, 48994, 8005, '<td valign="top">Hey, I thought you could not take camera''s in a casino.</td>', 'Hey, I thought you could not take camera''s in a casino.', '2003-12-06 15:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(505501, 49284, 8005, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. Really ugly ring.</td>', 'Interesting picture. Really ugly ring.', '2003-12-06 15:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(505503, 49351, 13735, '<td valign="top">Try better title next time; otherwise - the pic is splendid! High 8!</td>', 'Try better title next time; otherwise - the pic is splendid! High 8!', '2003-12-06 15:57:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(505504, 49309, 13735, '<td valign="top">Ideal for some other challenge, but... Nevertheless - I like it!</td>', 'Ideal for some other challenge, but... Nevertheless - I like it!', '2003-12-06 15:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(505505, 49213, 13735, '<td valign="top">Splendid idea! Done almost (!) perfectly. High 8.</td>', 'Splendid idea! Done almost (!) perfectly. High 8.', '2003-12-06 16:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(505510, 49109, 13735, '<td valign="top">Rather clumsy "underground" and composition - otherwise just right metaphor!</td>', 'Rather clumsy "underground" and composition - otherwise just right metaphor!', '2003-12-06 16:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(505514, 49364, 13735, '<td valign="top">Deja vu!</td>', 'Deja vu!', '2003-12-06 16:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(505519, 49249, 13735, '<td valign="top">So witty "solution"! Glad to see that.</td>', 'So witty "solution"! Glad to see that.', '2003-12-06 16:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(505536, 49213, 12311, '<td valign="top">Excellent color, focus, and detail. I can''t imagine how you got the dollar sign reflection in the eye, ...but I''ll assume it''s within the rules..  My score: 8</td>', 'Excellent color, focus, and detail. I can''t imagine how you got the dollar sign reflection in the eye, ...but I''ll assume it''s within the rules..  My score: 8', '2003-12-06 17:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(505537, 49255, 12311, '<td valign="top">This captures the essence of money, doesn''t it.  Too bad you couldn''t get the shot without the legs in the background.  ...But, I like it nonetheless.  Score: 7</td>', 'This captures the essence of money, doesn''t it.  Too bad you couldn''t get the shot without the legs in the background.  ...But, I like it nonetheless.  Score: 7', '2003-12-06 17:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(505539, 49245, 12311, '<td valign="top">A VERY wise choice!</td>', 'A VERY wise choice!', '2003-12-06 17:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(505544, 49392, 11687, '<td valign="top">haha - this was fun and creative.  thanks!  (with this were a little better exposed)</td>', 'haha - this was fun and creative.  thanks!  (with this were a little better exposed)', '2003-12-06 17:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(505545, 49252, 11687, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and DoF.  Nice work!</td>', 'Excellent lighting and DoF.  Nice work!', '2003-12-06 17:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(505547, 49426, 11687, '<td valign="top">Seems like you need one more card to make the fan symetrical at the edges.  Nice idea.</td>', 'Seems like you need one more card to make the fan symetrical at the edges.  Nice idea.', '2003-12-06 17:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(505549, 49397, 11687, '<td valign="top">A royal flush made its appearance at our weekly poker game just last week.  Everyone was in awe :)  <br/> <br/>I''d have like to see a higher value chip to go along with this, but other than that this is a great shot.</td>', 'A royal flush made its appearance at our weekly poker game just last week.  Everyone was in awe :)   I''d have like to see a higher value chip to go along with this, but other than that this is a great shot.', '2003-12-06 17:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(505551, 49418, 11687, '<td valign="top">I liked the idea, but I don''t think this is within the guidelines of the challenge.  <br/> <br/>"Here''s the catch: you can''t include any real currency (or the likeness of real currency) in your shot."</td>', 'I liked the idea, but I don''t think this is within the guidelines of the challenge.   "Here''s the catch: you can''t include any real currency (or the likeness of real currency) in your shot."', '2003-12-06 17:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(505567, 49037, 14001, '<td valign="top">I ddin''t like the cropping.  Good pic though.</td>', 'I ddin''t like the cropping.  Good pic though.', '2003-12-06 18:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(505568, 49321, 14001, '<td valign="top">I hate doing bills, thanks for reminding me.</td>', 'I hate doing bills, thanks for reminding me.', '2003-12-06 18:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(505569, 49383, 14001, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea.  Not intriqued by the lighting or the crumply table.</td>', 'Excellent idea.  Not intriqued by the lighting or the crumply table.', '2003-12-06 18:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(505572, 49073, 14001, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I get it.  Why am I looking through a mag lens?</td>', 'I''m not sure I get it.  Why am I looking through a mag lens?', '2003-12-06 18:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(505573, 49159, 14001, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.</td>', 'Nice idea.', '2003-12-06 18:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(505578, 48741, 14001, '<td valign="top">Nice effect.</td>', 'Nice effect.', '2003-12-06 18:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(505581, 49362, 14001, '<td valign="top">You could have got yourself in trouble for this pic.  Extra point for guts!</td>', 'You could have got yourself in trouble for this pic.  Extra point for guts!', '2003-12-06 18:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(505587, 49013, 14001, '<td valign="top">Winner!</td>', 'Winner!', '2003-12-06 18:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(505590, 48872, 14001, '<td valign="top">Nice pic.  I would have liked, "Money.....even this."</td>', 'Nice pic.  I would have liked, "Money.....even this."', '2003-12-06 18:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(505627, 49388, 3649, '<td valign="top">I love the gritty dark nature of this shot, the contrast and textures are great. focus is just a tad soft, but it fits. my top pick.</td>', 'I love the gritty dark nature of this shot, the contrast and textures are great. focus is just a tad soft, but it fits. my top pick.', '2003-12-06 19:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(505647, 49269, 12611, '<td valign="top">I think I get it</td>', 'I think I get it', '2003-12-06 20:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(505648, 49392, 12611, '<td valign="top">did you watch alot of daytime TV in the eighties?</td>', 'did you watch alot of daytime TV in the eighties?', '2003-12-06 20:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(505649, 49028, 12611, '<td valign="top">I believe the term is "bling bling" nice sepia tone;</td>', 'I believe the term is "bling bling" nice sepia tone;', '2003-12-06 21:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(505650, 48854, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice night shot - I like this one.</td>', 'Nice night shot - I like this one.', '2003-12-06 21:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(505651, 49281, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is grainy and pretty silly. when it was cropped, I lost sharpness or got bent or something. It has the overall impression of a terrible photcopy- if that is what you are looking to say- youv''e said it.</td>', 'This is grainy and pretty silly. when it was cropped, I lost sharpness or got bent or something. It has the overall impression of a terrible photcopy- if that is what you are looking to say- youv''e said it.', '2003-12-06 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(505652, 49350, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is a good try at a clever studio shot. I''ll give you 9 for meeting the challenge,  6 for technical merit, and 6 on the "pleasing to the eye" scale.</td>', 'This is a good try at a clever studio shot. I''ll give you 9 for meeting the challenge,  6 for technical merit, and 6 on the "pleasing to the eye" scale.', '2003-12-06 21:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(505653, 49395, 12611, '<td valign="top">There is a lott of credit card shots in this challenge- but I like your approach- so close. very nice, wait.. those are my credit card numbers!</td>', 'There is a lott of credit card shots in this challenge- but I like your approach- so close. very nice, wait.. those are my credit card numbers!', '2003-12-06 21:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(505667, 49395, 14001, '<td valign="top">Best credit card pic for sure.</td>', 'Best credit card pic for sure.', '2003-12-06 21:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(505669, 49127, 14001, '<td valign="top">It seems as though you cropped it too tight on the right side.</td>', 'It seems as though you cropped it too tight on the right side.', '2003-12-06 21:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(505671, 49213, 14001, '<td valign="top">Nice catchlight!</td>', 'Nice catchlight!', '2003-12-06 21:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(505673, 49252, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot.  The lines leading you in, the cclarity of the overall shot, the DOF is well done, even the hand is a good choice in that it''s not manicured and perfect, just a touch of need in the scruffiness of the fingernails, clean but a bit wanting.  I had a 9 on this but am going to make it a 10, well done.</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot.  The lines leading you in, the cclarity of the overall shot, the DOF is well done, even the hand is a good choice in that it''s not manicured and perfect, just a touch of need in the scruffiness of the fingernails, clean but a bit wanting.  I had a 9 on this but am going to make it a 10, well done.', '2003-12-06 21:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(505675, 48859, 12448, '<td valign="top">This scored low initially because it contains money, which was not supposed to be used and also the overall shot leaves me wanting.  Perhaps if it was titled to give me an idea what you were going for.  The lighting is also wanting in this shot, it''s too dark and almost seems underwater.  The container the money is is is alos a bit confusing, it draws you in but the back is very distracting, almost looks like an ice cube on behind the bills but not quite.  The overall clarity is there but the contrast is also lacking to me.  I started this at a one simply because it was dark, unappealling and did not meet the challenge.  Coming back I am raising the score to a 4 for the shot itself because it''s not really that bad.</td>', 'This scored low initially because it contains money, which was not supposed to be used and also the overall shot leaves me wanting.  Perhaps if it was titled to give me an idea what you were going for.  The lighting is also wanting in this shot, it''s too dark and almost seems underwater.  The container the money is is is alos a bit confusing, it draws you in but the back is very distracting, almost looks like an ice cube on behind the bills but not quite.  The overall clarity is there but the contrast is also lacking to me.  I started this at a one simply because it was dark, unappealling and did not meet the challenge.  Coming back I am raising the score to a 4 for the shot itself because it''s not really that bad.', '2003-12-06 21:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(505677, 49418, 12448, '<td valign="top">A cute idea but as I''m sure you''ve heard so far, it does not meet the challenge and therefore is losing points for that.<br/> <br/>As for the shot, I like the idea but a couple of things bother me about this shot.  The border to start, to heavy on the black outside, the inner borders are very well done but the outside is too much.  The drawing on the bill is to messy overall.  A finer marker with more time would really make this work I think.  Using the other bills for borders is a good idea but you only have three sides covered, one across the bottom would have completed the picture and made it look more finished to me.  I started with a 2 because of not meeting the challenge and the shot just didn''t really appeal to me but upon further inspection I am going to a 5</td>', 'A cute idea but as I''m sure you''ve heard so far, it does not meet the challenge and therefore is losing points for that. As for the shot, I like the idea but a couple of things bother me about this shot.  The border to start, to heavy on the black outside, the inner borders are very well done but the outside is too much.  The drawing on the bill is to messy overall.  A finer marker with more time would really make this work I think.  Using the other bills for borders is a good idea but you only have three sides covered, one across the bottom would have completed the picture and made it look more finished to me.  I started with a 2 because of not meeting the challenge and the shot just didn''t really appeal to me but upon further inspection I am going to a 5', '2003-12-06 21:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(505687, 48999, 6477, '<td valign="top">Red is a good choice in this shot... good luck!</td>', 'Red is a good choice in this shot... good luck!', '2003-12-06 22:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(505727, 49240, 12131, '<td valign="top">I love the clarity of the hologram.  The stone in ring is beautiful, is that an emerald?  If there is one thing I would suggest it would be to lessen the white some how, it seems to take up more space then the actual subjects.</td>', 'I love the clarity of the hologram.  The stone in ring is beautiful, is that an emerald?  If there is one thing I would suggest it would be to lessen the white some how, it seems to take up more space then the actual subjects.', '2003-12-07 01:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(505728, 49415, 12131, '<td valign="top">This could be an ad for the candy or bow tie, I don''t know how a jeweler would feel.  I like it because it''s playful.  I am a bit thrown off though because it is...such a clash of content.  Still fun picture.</td>', 'This could be an ad for the candy or bow tie, I don''t know how a jeweler would feel.  I like it because it''s playful.  I am a bit thrown off though because it is...such a clash of content.  Still fun picture.', '2003-12-07 01:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(505729, 49163, 12131, '<td valign="top">Wow, how do you keep all those straight?  Like the wallet and all that, but there seems to be a bit more white than anything else, maybe spread them out and smug out the info on the cards?</td>', 'Wow, how do you keep all those straight?  Like the wallet and all that, but there seems to be a bit more white than anything else, maybe spread them out and smug out the info on the cards?', '2003-12-07 01:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(505730, 48872, 12131, '<td valign="top">Very seductive lighting and color.  I am troubled by her face though, what is she looking at?  Is that a cigarette she''s smoking?  Other than that, clever choice but sad that it''s true.</td>', 'Very seductive lighting and color.  I am troubled by her face though, what is she looking at?  Is that a cigarette she''s smoking?  Other than that, clever choice but sad that it''s true.', '2003-12-07 01:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(505731, 49366, 12131, '<td valign="top">Good shot, the wallet with all the cards is great but you filled in the space around it nicely.  It looks like an endless landscape of debt.</td>', 'Good shot, the wallet with all the cards is great but you filled in the space around it nicely.  It looks like an endless landscape of debt.', '2003-12-07 01:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(505732, 49207, 12131, '<td valign="top">I like this one, it''s like you don''t know quite what you are getting into because of the darkness and the fact that the cat looks like a fragile piggy bank says that it''s unstable.  I like the fact that it is a cat, their such sophisticated clever animals.</td>', 'I like this one, it''s like you don''t know quite what you are getting into because of the darkness and the fact that the cat looks like a fragile piggy bank says that it''s unstable.  I like the fact that it is a cat, their such sophisticated clever animals.', '2003-12-07 01:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(505734, 49284, 12131, '<td valign="top">That''s a different sort of mounting. I like the wire work, though I don''t much like the cut of the stone.  Still good choice of image.</td>', 'That''s a different sort of mounting. I like the wire work, though I don''t much like the cut of the stone.  Still good choice of image.', '2003-12-07 01:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(505735, 49252, 12131, '<td valign="top">Hmm, hope you win.  Do you choose by birthdays, age or just at random?</td>', 'Hmm, hope you win.  Do you choose by birthdays, age or just at random?', '2003-12-07 01:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(505736, 49364, 12131, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, how did you do this?  I hope you tell us in your explanation when the challenge is over.</td>', 'Interesting effect, how did you do this?  I hope you tell us in your explanation when the challenge is over.', '2003-12-07 01:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(505738, 49298, 12131, '<td valign="top">So, is that the real thing? Or did you use flour to demonstrate?  Kinda scary, really sad.  Excellent image though.</td>', 'So, is that the real thing? Or did you use flour to demonstrate?  Kinda scary, really sad.  Excellent image though.', '2003-12-07 01:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(505739, 49125, 12131, '<td valign="top">Yikes! That''s a high number.  Hope that''s in your favor.  Bills suck!  Nice shot.</td>', 'Yikes! That''s a high number.  Hope that''s in your favor.  Bills suck!  Nice shot.', '2003-12-07 01:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(505740, 49409, 12131, '<td valign="top">I see seirra club, Davey Crocket, the Pueblo Indians and upper class society all roled into this shot, and money over all of it.   Good work.</td>', 'I see seirra club, Davey Crocket, the Pueblo Indians and upper class society all roled into this shot, and money over all of it.   Good work.', '2003-12-07 01:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(505741, 49395, 12131, '<td valign="top">That''s the kind of image they like for their ads, are you shooting for them?  The bird is nicely ghostly.</td>', 'That''s the kind of image they like for their ads, are you shooting for them?  The bird is nicely ghostly.', '2003-12-07 01:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(505742, 49386, 12131, '<td valign="top">That''s adorable, but is the tutu holding her together?</td>', 'That''s adorable, but is the tutu holding her together?', '2003-12-07 01:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(505743, 49120, 12131, '<td valign="top">Those eyes are creeping me out!  Nicely set up, the mini village in the backgrounds a great touch.</td>', 'Those eyes are creeping me out!  Nicely set up, the mini village in the backgrounds a great touch.', '2003-12-07 01:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(505744, 49355, 12131, '<td valign="top">Ick!  But great play on words.</td>', 'Ick!  But great play on words.', '2003-12-07 01:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(505745, 49370, 12131, '<td valign="top">I like the choice, and the interpretation, but the image comes across a little blurry.  Maybe thats the effect you are looking for, but I think I would have liked it more if perhaps the sky was a little less bleak at the time you took the shot, not that that can really be helped.</td>', 'I like the choice, and the interpretation, but the image comes across a little blurry.  Maybe thats the effect you are looking for, but I think I would have liked it more if perhaps the sky was a little less bleak at the time you took the shot, not that that can really be helped.', '2003-12-07 01:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(505746, 49071, 12131, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of The Prince and the Pauper. Good choice, very clear.</td>', 'Reminds me of The Prince and the Pauper. Good choice, very clear.', '2003-12-07 01:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(505748, 49371, 12131, '<td valign="top">Great image but who''s the cat playing?  The cups are a little distracting.</td>', 'Great image but who''s the cat playing?  The cups are a little distracting.', '2003-12-07 01:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(505749, 49418, 12131, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but I thought the rules said you couldn''t use actual money.  Still, I like the devil image, money is like that.</td>', 'Good shot, but I thought the rules said you couldn''t use actual money.  Still, I like the devil image, money is like that.', '2003-12-07 01:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
