(505766, 49241, 13403, '<td valign="top">hehe..    you own a lot of watches...</td>', 'hehe..    you own a lot of watches...', '2003-12-07 03:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(505767, 49127, 9809, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. This photo looks surreal.</td>', 'Nicely done. This photo looks surreal.', '2003-12-07 03:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(505768, 49346, 9809, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve seen too many "Time is Money" shots in this challenge and I''m not even half way through voting -- on the other hand, this is the best "Time is Money" shot I''ve seen so far. Good points: That second hand. Obviously a 7 (or 8?) second exposure. Bad points: I don''t like that long shadow on the right of the watch. Perhaps if the constrast wasn''t so great. Still, nice photo overall.</td>', 'I think I''ve seen too many "Time is Money" shots in this challenge and I''m not even half way through voting -- on the other hand, this is the best "Time is Money" shot I''ve seen so far. Good points: That second hand. Obviously a 7 (or 8?) second exposure. Bad points: I don''t like that long shadow on the right of the watch. Perhaps if the constrast wasn''t so great. Still, nice photo overall.', '2003-12-07 03:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(505774, 49347, 4008, '<td valign="top">Is that a shadow of a hammer ? Hardly visible. Picture would be much more outspoken if the hammer itself would have been included.</td>', 'Is that a shadow of a hammer ? Hardly visible. Picture would be much more outspoken if the hammer itself would have been included.', '2003-12-07 06:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(505776, 48872, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice light, nice body, does not reall express money to me very strongly, except for the red light/sheets.</td>', 'Nice light, nice body, does not reall express money to me very strongly, except for the red light/sheets.', '2003-12-07 06:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(505777, 49345, 4008, '<td valign="top">Would this picture express money without the title ? No, not to me. Nice picture though.</td>', 'Would this picture express money without the title ? No, not to me. Nice picture though.', '2003-12-07 06:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(505779, 48966, 4008, '<td valign="top">A pity that this jewelry has just been thrown together in one big mess, some are even upside down. In my opinion the composition needs much more work and you have plenty of material to play with. I Would compose them neatly, in an attrative way, to express more class, to express more money.</td>', 'A pity that this jewelry has just been thrown together in one big mess, some are even upside down. In my opinion the composition needs much more work and you have plenty of material to play with. I Would compose them neatly, in an attrative way, to express more class, to express more money.', '2003-12-07 06:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(505841, 49210, 13735, '<td valign="top">Imposing &amp; persuasive... Man!</td>', 'Imposing & persuasive... Man!', '2003-12-07 11:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(505842, 49372, 13735, '<td valign="top">I find your title clumsy... The pic says it in its own words...<br/>Rather good.</td>', 'I find your title clumsy... The pic says it in its own words...Rather good.', '2003-12-07 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(505848, 49260, 14008, '<td valign="top">One of the very few that doesn''t need a title to connect it to the challenge - nice concept executed very well.</td>', 'One of the very few that doesn''t need a title to connect it to the challenge - nice concept executed very well.', '2003-12-07 12:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(505849, 49125, 14008, '<td valign="top">Actually quite witty.</td>', 'Actually quite witty.', '2003-12-07 12:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(505873, 49409, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wow, another unique idea, it made me cheer up. :-) Just after I heard how much a lens could cost, I can imagine, you have spent heaps for this one. I love the composition here, and that the soft hat(?) gives a nice touch to your main subject. Lighting also works well, colours are in harmony and I like your border, too. :-) Good luck!</td>', 'Wow, another unique idea, it made me cheer up. :-) Just after I heard how much a lens could cost, I can imagine, you have spent heaps for this one. I love the composition here, and that the soft hat(?) gives a nice touch to your main subject. Lighting also works well, colours are in harmony and I like your border, too. :-) Good luck!', '2003-12-07 13:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(505875, 49071, 10858, '<td valign="top">Another photo, where I have to say wow. :-) The opposites work extremely well here, and the eyes of the boy match the rule of thirds certenly. Lighting gives this photo a dramatic feeling, it seems like richness means light, poor boy is in the dark. Maybe I would like to see the photo in full B&amp;W style, but with or without colours, one of my favs during this challenge. :-) Good luck!<br/>Ah, and tell your young model that he is is a great actor. :-)</td>', 'Another photo, where I have to say wow. :-) The opposites work extremely well here, and the eyes of the boy match the rule of thirds certenly. Lighting gives this photo a dramatic feeling, it seems like richness means light, poor boy is in the dark. Maybe I would like to see the photo in full B&W style, but with or without colours, one of my favs during this challenge. :-) Good luck!Ah, and tell your young model that he is is a great actor. :-)', '2003-12-07 13:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(505881, 48859, 10858, '<td valign="top">Is this real money? I thought it was not allowed to photograph any real or real-alike money for this challenge. The photo is nice, anyway, maybe I would have used a portrait style for it, in order to show more of the coin flood.</td>', 'Is this real money? I thought it was not allowed to photograph any real or real-alike money for this challenge. The photo is nice, anyway, maybe I would have used a portrait style for it, in order to show more of the coin flood.', '2003-12-07 13:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(505902, 49414, 8891, '<td valign="top">THe overall shot is very good and I''ll take your word for the subject fitting the title but what is with the pose? Neither standing or sitting, she appears to be in mid squat for some reason.</td>', 'THe overall shot is very good and I''ll take your word for the subject fitting the title but what is with the pose? Neither standing or sitting, she appears to be in mid squat for some reason.', '2003-12-07 14:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(505905, 49278, 8891, '<td valign="top">nice reflections, the unreflected buildings appear a bit over eposed, bu the reflections are fine and great reflections.</td>', 'nice reflections, the unreflected buildings appear a bit over eposed, bu the reflections are fine and great reflections.', '2003-12-07 14:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(505906, 49401, 8891, '<td valign="top">my small mind is not able to grasp the purpose of your choice of focus.  What is in focus is very nicely lit and exposed. Just don''t get the rest, though I appreciate the fine choice of composition.</td>', 'my small mind is not able to grasp the purpose of your choice of focus.  What is in focus is very nicely lit and exposed. Just don''t get the rest, though I appreciate the fine choice of composition.', '2003-12-07 14:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
