(505985, 49375, 8891, '<td valign="top">nice pouch, money being the subject I would have put in more foreground so that it was better lit....don''t know know what the other object is, sorry, and I do not see the need for it here.....just the pouch and it''s shadow would have been a better choice, IMO.</td>', 'nice pouch, money being the subject I would have put in more foreground so that it was better lit....don''t know know what the other object is, sorry, and I do not see the need for it here.....just the pouch and it''s shadow would have been a better choice, IMO.', '2003-12-07 15:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
