(506126, 49116, 6938, '<td valign="top">Pity about the flaring.  Otherwise a nice clean shot.<br/></td>', 'Pity about the flaring.  Otherwise a nice clean shot.', '2003-12-07 19:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(506144, 49402, 6938, '<td valign="top">Too dark.</td>', 'Too dark.', '2003-12-07 20:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(506145, 49371, 6938, '<td valign="top">Cool candid shot of the cat,   but I don''t think it plays in this challange.  Good lighting and focus.<br/></td>', 'Cool candid shot of the cat,   but I don''t think it plays in this challange.  Good lighting and focus.', '2003-12-07 20:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(506147, 49125, 6938, '<td valign="top">Did you try a shot with the beans spilling out of the can over the paperwork?<br/></td>', 'Did you try a shot with the beans spilling out of the can over the paperwork?', '2003-12-07 20:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(506149, 49347, 2716, '<td valign="top">lol.  That is too funny!! thanks for the chuckles.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'lol.  That is too funny!! thanks for the chuckles.  Jacko.  9', '2003-12-07 20:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(506160, 49401, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent quality work here... Definitely ad quality...</td>', 'Excellent quality work here... Definitely ad quality...', '2003-12-07 21:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(506172, 49404, 12475, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge. I''d like to see more detail and color variation though; still really like the shot.</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge. I''d like to see more detail and color variation though; still really like the shot.', '2003-12-07 21:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(506173, 49383, 12475, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic response; good job.</td>', 'Nice dramatic response; good job.', '2003-12-07 21:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(506182, 48889, 12448, '<td valign="top">Well, interesting concept but it really just doesn''t grab my attention and keep it.  I see two one dollar bills sitting on a white board that is well lit.  They don''t really look like they are floating to me.  The top one possibly but not the bottom one, maybe if there were some sort of motion blur or something.  Second the challenge was pretty specific on this one, no money :(  A 3</td>', 'Well, interesting concept but it really just doesn''t grab my attention and keep it.  I see two one dollar bills sitting on a white board that is well lit.  They don''t really look like they are floating to me.  The top one possibly but not the bottom one, maybe if there were some sort of motion blur or something.  Second the challenge was pretty specific on this one, no money :(  A 3', '2003-12-07 22:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(506184, 48965, 12448, '<td valign="top">I can''t really tell what this is supposed to be.  The blur really hurts this shot. It almost looks like a chain but ooooooooo, I see now, a dollar sign, duh!  Okay, I see it now but it still doesn''t appeal to me.  The border is distracting to me and while the angle through the shot is good, taking you from one corner to another it''s too undefined to really work for me.  A 3</td>', 'I can''t really tell what this is supposed to be.  The blur really hurts this shot. It almost looks like a chain but ooooooooo, I see now, a dollar sign, duh!  Okay, I see it now but it still doesn''t appeal to me.  The border is distracting to me and while the angle through the shot is good, taking you from one corner to another it''s too undefined to really work for me.  A 3', '2003-12-07 22:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(506186, 49034, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes it is.  I like the idea behind the shot but the shot itself leaves me really wanting. The blurriness of the clock face is very distracting and the blow out of the light on the left is almost blinding.  I can see and would accept the motion blur of the pendelum  but not the rest of the clock.  The coloration on the right is also off to me, should be white all the way across.  A 3</td>', 'Yes it is.  I like the idea behind the shot but the shot itself leaves me really wanting. The blurriness of the clock face is very distracting and the blow out of the light on the left is almost blinding.  I can see and would accept the motion blur of the pendelum  but not the rest of the clock.  The coloration on the right is also off to me, should be white all the way across.  A 3', '2003-12-07 22:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(506187, 49312, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes, sadly they do.   The concept is good the shot is wanting. The trees are very distracting and really take away from your shot for me.  The border is a bit to much gold, you don''t have enough in the shot to carry it off.  Perhaps if you had flipped the black and gold borders?  And a more direct shot of the steeple of the church without all the branches if possible and a bit more clairty and contrast.  A 3</td>', 'Yes, sadly they do.   The concept is good the shot is wanting. The trees are very distracting and really take away from your shot for me.  The border is a bit to much gold, you don''t have enough in the shot to carry it off.  Perhaps if you had flipped the black and gold borders?  And a more direct shot of the steeple of the church without all the branches if possible and a bit more clairty and contrast.  A 3', '2003-12-07 22:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(506188, 49370, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes it is and I sure could have used some this past week!  This is a wonderful concept but the pulling off leaves me wanting.  I''m guessing you were going for a soft focus feel on this shot but it really deosn''t work for me, comes off more of a fuzzy shot than soft.  The tiny bit of water on the left make me want more.  Perhaps if the shot was panned more to the left, taking out the houses on the right, leaving just the one house or even just the canoe/boat and the sea to the left would really bring the message across, all the houses just add more clutter/stress to me.  A 3</td>', 'Yes it is and I sure could have used some this past week!  This is a wonderful concept but the pulling off leaves me wanting.  I''m guessing you were going for a soft focus feel on this shot but it really deosn''t work for me, comes off more of a fuzzy shot than soft.  The tiny bit of water on the left make me want more.  Perhaps if the shot was panned more to the left, taking out the houses on the right, leaving just the one house or even just the canoe/boat and the sea to the left would really bring the message across, all the houses just add more clutter/stress to me.  A 3', '2003-12-07 22:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(506189, 49003, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this has to do with the challenge and the motion blur is very distracting.  The border also seems very heavy for this shot.  A 4</td>', 'Not sure what this has to do with the challenge and the motion blur is very distracting.  The border also seems very heavy for this shot.  A 4', '2003-12-07 22:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(506190, 49284, 12448, '<td valign="top">That is one big rock!  But not so big that it should affect the DOF on the middle finger, seems to me the entire shot should be in sharp focus.  Also the light is blown out on the top and shining off the fingers.  Perhaps if you had come from the other side, like someone was showing off the ring and you could see the entire hand?  A 4</td>', 'That is one big rock!  But not so big that it should affect the DOF on the middle finger, seems to me the entire shot should be in sharp focus.  Also the light is blown out on the top and shining off the fingers.  Perhaps if you had come from the other side, like someone was showing off the ring and you could see the entire hand?  A 4', '2003-12-07 22:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(506191, 49407, 12448, '<td valign="top">That would be nice, no doubt.  But there is no real focus in this shot, not one car is the center of attention and perhaps that is what you were going for but to me, the balance seems off and the angle of the shot is off, perhaps a more direct angle and making one car the center with all the others leading off that one, like little clones.  A 4</td>', 'That would be nice, no doubt.  But there is no real focus in this shot, not one car is the center of attention and perhaps that is what you were going for but to me, the balance seems off and the angle of the shot is off, perhaps a more direct angle and making one car the center with all the others leading off that one, like little clones.  A 4', '2003-12-07 22:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(506192, 48971, 12448, '<td valign="top">Ah, money in the shot :(  But a nice shot otherwise.  This is one of the few I didn''t punish you as much as I did the others for not reading the description on this one more carefully.  I like the DOF on this shot, the black and white works very well and the off center of the coin is also nice.  The angle seems off for some reason though, like it could be more head on so the printing on the coin was straighter?  A 5</td>', 'Ah, money in the shot :(  But a nice shot otherwise.  This is one of the few I didn''t punish you as much as I did the others for not reading the description on this one more carefully.  I like the DOF on this shot, the black and white works very well and the off center of the coin is also nice.  The angle seems off for some reason though, like it could be more head on so the printing on the coin was straighter?  A 5', '2003-12-07 22:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(506193, 49380, 12448, '<td valign="top">Sadly there are too many of them out there.  This looks like a set up shot but at the same time a walk by shot.  The fish eye effect is a bit much and the homeless person looks too clean and the clothes look too new it''s hard to say.  The focus is lacking a bit and while the black and white works well with this shot but the brightness and contrast is just a bit wanting.  A 4 to start, going to a 7</td>', 'Sadly there are too many of them out there.  This looks like a set up shot but at the same time a walk by shot.  The fish eye effect is a bit much and the homeless person looks too clean and the clothes look too new it''s hard to say.  The focus is lacking a bit and while the black and white works well with this shot but the brightness and contrast is just a bit wanting.  A 4 to start, going to a 7', '2003-12-07 22:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(506196, 49283, 12448, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, doesn''t really make me think of money per say but interesting all the same.  Not quite sure what they are selling, is it flowers?  And the motion blur of the traffic or train behind is perfect but the customer in the middle is more distracting.  The border seems a bit heavy to me, too much for this shot.  A 4 to start a 5 to finish</td>', 'Interesting shot, doesn''t really make me think of money per say but interesting all the same.  Not quite sure what they are selling, is it flowers?  And the motion blur of the traffic or train behind is perfect but the customer in the middle is more distracting.  The border seems a bit heavy to me, too much for this shot.  A 4 to start a 5 to finish', '2003-12-07 22:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(506228, 49429, 6938, '<td valign="top">Nice framing of the branding.</td>', 'Nice framing of the branding.', '2003-12-07 23:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
