(506324, 49352, 14522, '<td valign="top">You may have a slight overexposure on the hands. This could be as a result of the black of the machine causing your camera to compensate for what it belives to be a dark scene</td>', 'You may have a slight overexposure on the hands. This could be as a result of the black of the machine causing your camera to compensate for what it belives to be a dark scene', '2003-12-08 01:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
