(507808, 49361, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure and lighting good, but a little flat. Composition good. Focus seems a bit off.<br/> <br/>Personal: Doesn''t make me go "wow". The "budget" and "expenses" sheets are too obviously set up for me, computer printouts containing information (instead of just titles) would have made better props.<br/> <br/>My vote: 4</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure and lighting good, but a little flat. Composition good. Focus seems a bit off. Personal: Doesn''t make me go "wow". The "budget" and "expenses" sheets are too obviously set up for me, computer printouts containing information (instead of just titles) would have made better props. My vote: 4', '2003-12-09 09:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(507809, 49363, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good. The DOF makes it slightly more interesting.<br/> <br/>Personal: Doesn''t compel me or make me want to take a second look<br/> <br/>My vote: 3</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good. The DOF makes it slightly more interesting. Personal: Doesn''t compel me or make me want to take a second look My vote: 3', '2003-12-09 09:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(507810, 49424, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good, but uninteresting.<br/> <br/>Personal: Not creative or compelling.<br/> <br/>My vote: 3</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good, but uninteresting. Personal: Not creative or compelling. My vote: 3', '2003-12-09 09:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(507812, 49357, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus and lighting all pretty uninteresting. A little time could have been taken to avoid reflections on the face.<br/> <br/>Personal: There are plenty of ways this could have been a more creative shot, had you taken the time and effort.<br/> <br/>My vote: 2</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus and lighting all pretty uninteresting. A little time could have been taken to avoid reflections on the face. Personal: There are plenty of ways this could have been a more creative shot, had you taken the time and effort. My vote: 2', '2003-12-09 09:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(507814, 49328, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all excellent! Very contrasty.<br/> <br/>Personal: Beautiful shot.<br/> <br/>My vote: 8</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all excellent! Very contrasty. Personal: Beautiful shot. My vote: 8', '2003-12-09 09:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(507820, 49109, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition and focus appear good, but it''s a hard to tell because the background is very distracting and the lighting is confusing. It makes the items hard to see clearly. I see a cabbage (I think- is that what the purple thing is? Does it have a disease or holes in it or something?), a coin roll and some shells, but I''m not sure what the other two things are. <br/> <br/>Personal: Ambitious idea, a little overdone for me. Definite points for effort!<br/> <br/>My vote: 5</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition and focus appear good, but it''s a hard to tell because the background is very distracting and the lighting is confusing. It makes the items hard to see clearly. I see a cabbage (I think- is that what the purple thing is? Does it have a disease or holes in it or something?), a coin roll and some shells, but I''m not sure what the other two things are.  Personal: Ambitious idea, a little overdone for me. Definite points for effort! My vote: 5', '2003-12-09 09:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(507829, 48995, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good... I''m assuming this photograph is taken through glass or something, which is causing the washed out effect? A little more contrast particularly where the lettering at the top is concerned might be helpful in conveying what exactly the subject is.<br/> <br/>Personal: Very interesting, artistic, makes me want to look. I just wish I had a little more clue as to what I''m looking at!<br/> <br/>My vote: 6</td>', 'Technical: Fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good... I''m assuming this photograph is taken through glass or something, which is causing the washed out effect? A little more contrast particularly where the lettering at the top is concerned might be helpful in conveying what exactly the subject is. Personal: Very interesting, artistic, makes me want to look. I just wish I had a little more clue as to what I''m looking at! My vote: 6', '2003-12-09 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
