(507855, 48971, 10858, '<td valign="top">Ah, a Hungarian coin! :-) I thought we were not allowed to use real banknotes or coins, anyway. About the photo, I would have cut a bit above, it would help the rule of thirds make an effect on your shot. What I love: this is a beautiful macro shot: hey men, this coin is smaller than a centimeter, and lighting and focus are excellent for this shot! The only problem is that a real coin is included.</td>', 'Ah, a Hungarian coin! :-) I thought we were not allowed to use real banknotes or coins, anyway. About the photo, I would have cut a bit above, it would help the rule of thirds make an effect on your shot. What I love: this is a beautiful macro shot: hey men, this coin is smaller than a centimeter, and lighting and focus are excellent for this shot! The only problem is that a real coin is included.', '2003-12-09 10:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
