(508507, 49364, 6202, '<td valign="top">Congrats Terry on the win, its a very nice droplet photo.  Now don''t be afraid to rub it in on those who complained about the cliche and overdone effect.  Cause you got the ribbon and they didn''t!</td>', 'Congrats Terry on the win, its a very nice droplet photo.  Now don''t be afraid to rub it in on those who complained about the cliche and overdone effect.  Cause you got the ribbon and they didn''t!', '2003-12-10 00:09:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(508508, 49418, 8816, '<td valign="top">Well, now ain''t this just embarassing!!  Now that the challenge is finally over I would like to apologize to everyone for this, I should''ve looked more carefully at the challenge description!  You shouldn''t have had to waste your time commenting and scoring this shot!  Thanks all for your comments.<br/> <br/>Lee</td>', 'Well, now ain''t this just embarassing!!  Now that the challenge is finally over I would like to apologize to everyone for this, I should''ve looked more carefully at the challenge description!  You shouldn''t have had to waste your time commenting and scoring this shot!  Thanks all for your comments. Lee', '2003-12-10 00:10:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(508509, 49124, 509, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  I''m not sure I understand the lack of sharpness comments, it looks sharp to me.  That said, this is pretty much the vote I expected.  The grill is stock, actually.  <br/> <br/>For a college student with only a co-op (similar to an internship) for income, a new car is a big investment.  The car is my "baby" ; )  So far I''m very happy with it.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  I''m not sure I understand the lack of sharpness comments, it looks sharp to me.  That said, this is pretty much the vote I expected.  The grill is stock, actually.   For a college student with only a co-op (similar to an internship) for income, a new car is a big investment.  The car is my "baby" ; )  So far I''m very happy with it.', '2003-12-10 00:10:28.000000', NULL, 0),
