(508951, 49009, 14621, '<td valign="top">Hi there,<br/>thanks for voting.<br/>I think very few people got my intentions. Many thought i made a mistake by neglecting the $ or the euro sign on the keyboard, but  my intention and that was the current business trend of email, internet and the web for which i thought this is an approprite money symbol<br/>neways thanks<br/>and spl for those who gave me a 10 :)</td>', 'Hi there,thanks for voting.I think very few people got my intentions. Many thought i made a mistake by neglecting the $ or the euro sign on the keyboard, but  my intention and that was the current business trend of email, internet and the web for which i thought this is an approprite money symbolneways thanksand spl for those who gave me a 10 :)', '2003-12-10 08:47:56.000000', NULL, 0),
