(509002, 49127, 9146, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the critique club,<br/> <br/>Negative: under exposed in the foreground, yet dark on the "porch"<br/>Might have benefited from a tighter crop....I''m not married to that idea, however.<br/> <br/>Positive:<br/>Nice choice of subject,<br/>Good capture on sky,<br/>Nice composition, <br/>Nice saturation, clarity, focus<br/> <br/>all in all I like this picture<br/> <br/>jo<br/> <br/></td>', 'Greetings from the critique club, Negative: under exposed in the foreground, yet dark on the "porch"Might have benefited from a tighter crop....I''m not married to that idea, however. Positive:Nice choice of subject,Good capture on sky,Nice composition, Nice saturation, clarity, focus all in all I like this picture jo ', '2003-12-10 09:49:24.000000', NULL, 0),
