(509018, 49260, 3102, '<td valign="top">I enjoyed reading your description!  My first instinct when I saw this was that you used a Photoshop filter to create the flames... but it was too good to be anything but real flames.  Way to go!  Treat yourself to a new pair of pants!  :)</td>', 'I enjoyed reading your description!  My first instinct when I saw this was that you used a Photoshop filter to create the flames... but it was too good to be anything but real flames.  Way to go!  Treat yourself to a new pair of pants!  :)', '2003-12-10 09:58:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(509084, 49009, 14773, '<td valign="top">"interesting photo. very weak on the theme of money"<br/> <br/>I can only assume that statement was from someone who could not admit that they just didn''t get it.  It is a brilliant piece and you should''ve placed much higher.  For me, I thought the statement was obvious.</td>', '"interesting photo. very weak on the theme of money" I can only assume that statement was from someone who could not admit that they just didn''t get it.  It is a brilliant piece and you should''ve placed much higher.  For me, I thought the statement was obvious.', '2003-12-10 10:20:55.000000', NULL, 0),
